  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>氨基甲酸酯类</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>霜霉威：局部内吸，抑制病原菌细胞膜合成，防黄瓜霜霉病、番茄晚疫病，促根系发育，常与氟吡菌胺复配，安全间隔期2-3天。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
