<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>霜脲氰：干扰RNA合成，治疗活性高但内吸弱，需喷透防黄瓜霜霉病，常与烯酰吗啉复配。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
