    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">胃毒剂</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>作用原理：害虫取食后，药剂进入消化系统，通过肠道吸收发挥毒杀作用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>适用场景：主要用于防治咀嚼式口器害虫（如菜青虫、毛毛虫、甲虫等）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
