    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.1.1 柑橘橙柚</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">细菌性病害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="text-color-red">溃疡病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>柑橘溃疡病（病原菌：Xanthomonas citri subsp. citri）是柑橘产业中最具毁灭性的细菌病害，被列为国内外植物检疫对象。该病可危害叶片、枝梢和果实，导致落叶、枯梢和落果，严重时可使果实商品价值降低30%-50%，甚至完全失去商品价值，通过气孔、皮孔或机械伤口侵入，尤其在高温多雨（25-30℃）季节高发。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>风雨传播：雨水飞溅是主要传播方式，病菌可随气流扩散至 500 米外。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农事操作：修剪工具、采果人员接触带菌组织后传播。</sp');
