    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业措施</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">修剪清园</span><span>：冬季剪除病枝、病叶，集中烧毁；生长期及时摘除发病组织，减少菌源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">优化栽培</span><span>：增施钙肥（如硝酸钙 20kg / 亩）和有机肥，增强叶片抗病力；合理密植（柚类建议 4×5m 株行距），改善通风透光条件。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">关键用药时期：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">春梢萌动期</span><span>（萌芽前7天）：喷施77%氢氧化铜500倍液，杀灭越冬病菌</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
