    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌为地毯草黄单胞菌柑橘致病型</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌在病叶、枝梢、病果病斑中越冬，秋梢病斑是主要越冬场所，翌年春季温度适宜且多雨时，病菌从病斑溢出，借风雨、昆虫、枝叶接触等传播到幼嫩组织，有水膜时20 分钟即可从气孔、皮孔或伤口侵入。高温多雨季节可多次再侵染，远距离传播靠带菌苗木、接穗和果实</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>①</span><span class="bold">检疫</span><span>：严格检疫繁殖材料和果实，建立无病苗圃</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">②农业措施</span><span>：冬季清园剪除病枝、清扫病残体销毁；合理施肥控氮增钾；抹除夏梢和早秋梢，统一放梢；果园布局防风林</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">③抗病品种</span><span>：选用宽皮橘类（如温州蜜柑系列）、杂柑系列等抗病品种</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">④药剂防治</span><span>：嫩梢期喷20% 噻菌铜悬浮剂 600倍液、70%氢氧化铜可湿性粉剂600 倍液等，间隔7-10 天喷1 次，交替用药</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
