<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>有性阶段：</span><span class="italic">Diaporthe medusaea</span><span>（柑橘间座壳，子囊菌亚门）；通过冻伤、虫伤等伤口侵入，高温多雨（25-30℃）季节高发。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>无性阶段：</span><span class="italic">Phomopsis cytosporella</span><span>（柑橘拟茎点霉菌，半知菌亚门）</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌以分生孢子器和分生孢子在病组织内越冬，借风雨、昆虫（天牛、吉丁虫等害虫携带病菌）传播，从伤口侵入；低温高湿 / 高温多雨、树势衰弱 / 冻害伤口、过熟果实易感病</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业措施：增施有机肥改良土壤，营造防风林改善生态，防寒防冻防伤保护枝干</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治：修剪后及时涂抹伤口愈合剂（如 3% 腐殖酸钠水剂），防止病菌侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>虫害防控：重点防治天牛、吉丁虫，减少机械伤口。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防寒防冻：冬季主干涂白（硫酸铜：生石灰：水 = 1:20:80），培土 30cm 保护根颈。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>喷药：春梢萌发期、花落 2/3、幼果期各喷1 次，可选0.5%-0.8% 石灰等量式波尔多液、50% 退菌特500-600 倍液、70%甲基硫菌灵 800 倍液等</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治（按效果排序）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗性杀菌剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>啶氧菌酯（22.5% 悬浮剂 2000 倍液）：穿透性强，抑制病菌呼吸作用，对树脂病特效。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>氟唑菌酰胺・咪鲜胺（18% 微囊悬浮剂 2000 倍液）：德国进口专利复配，双效协同，持效期 21 天以上。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>保护性杀菌剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>代森锰锌（80% 可湿性粉剂 600 倍液）：春梢萌芽前和幼果期喷施，兼防炭疽病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>丙森锌（70% 可湿性粉剂 500 倍液）：锌离子增强抗病力，适合果实膨大期使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>复配药剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>苯甲・嘧菌酯（32.5% 悬浮剂 1500 倍液）：内吸 + 保护，对树脂病和炭疽病双重防控。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>华南产区（广东、广西）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>树脂病：谢花后（啶氧菌酯 2000 倍液）+ 果实膨大期（氟唑菌酰胺・咪鲜胺 2000 倍液），结合修剪清除枯枝。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>枝干涂药：4-5月 /8-9 月纵刻病部后涂药（每期 3-4 次），药剂可选70% 甲基硫菌灵100 倍液、80% 大生M-45 100 倍液等，涂抹前用 1% 硫酸铜消毒</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>柑橘流胶病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>枝干：病斑不定形，初发病皮层出现红褐色小点，中央开裂流出胶液；老病斑可自然愈合或干燥翘裂；严重时病斑环绕树干，整株死亡</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片与果实：叶片中脉及侧脉深黄色易脱落，落叶枝梢干枯；病树开花多，幼果早落，残留果实小、提前转黄、味酸</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>区别特征：流胶病不深入树干木质部为害</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="childre');
