<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌复杂，国内已知12种，常见的有壳囊孢属真菌、疫菌、金黄尖镰孢霉、亚疫霉、寄生疫霉烟草致病变种等；有时单一病原菌侵染，有时多种复合侵染，其中疫菌感染和病斑扩散最快</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>季节与环境：高温多雨季节发病较重，菌核引起的流胶以冬季最盛；果园长期积水、土壤黏重、树冠郁闭、树干有伤口（虫害/人为）均利于发病</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种差异：四川地区柠檬、甜橙发病严重；浙江地区温州蜜柑（早熟品种更烈）、槾橘、早橘较重</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业措施：选用耐病砧木（枳、红橘等）并提高嫁接口位置；开沟排水改良土壤，避免积水；树干刷白、刨土，加强蛀干害虫防治</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：</span></div>
    
    
