    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌：寄生疫霉（</span><span class="italic">Phytophthora parasitica</span><span>），通过根系伤口侵入，高温高湿（25-30℃）季节高发，低洼积水果园易流行。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌为多种真菌，常见的有腐皮镰孢、寄生疫霉、柑橘褐腐疫霉、德氏腐霉、逸见腐霉等</span></div>
    
    
    
