    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌：煤炱属（</span><span class="italic">Capnodium</span><span>）和小煤炱属（</span><span class="italic">Meliola</span><span>）真菌，以蚜虫、粉虱、蚧壳虫的分泌物为营养，高温高湿（25-30℃）季节高发。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
