    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>新梢：覆盖白粉状菌丝层，叶片干缩贴附，重者枯死。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>幼果：初期有白粉层，无明显黄斑，霉层扩展后覆盖表面</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌为丹吉尔粉孢霉（</span><span class="italic">Oidiumtingitaninum</span><span>），属真菌界无性态子囊菌；菌丝白色半透明，附着胞圆形，分生孢子4~8个串生、无色</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温湿度：适温20~28℃，高湿+通风不良时爆发，春末夏初为主高峰410。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌以菌丝体在病组织越冬；翌年4~5月春梢抽长期产生分生孢子，借风雨传播，水滴中萌发侵染，重复为害春、夏、秋梢；适温18~23℃，多雨潮湿易流行；甜橙、温州蜜柑中晚熟品种等易感病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择：纽荷尔脐橙、温州蜜柑等抗病品种4。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>控湿修剪：疏除密枝，保持透光率＞30%，排水降湿10。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：剪除病枝梢、叶、果集中烧毁，合理修剪增强果园通透性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>关键期：春梢萌发期、发病初期（粉斑未扩散时）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂选择：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冬季喷1波石硫合剂清园；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>春梢抽发期/发病初期：喷石硫合剂、50%硫黄悬浮剂400倍液、50%甲基硫菌灵可湿性粉剂1000倍液；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>嫩梢抽发3~6cm时：喷50%锰锌・腈菌唑可湿性粉剂600倍液等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><div class="table-container"><table class="auto-table" border="1" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><thead><tr><th tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="column-select-btn" data-col="0" title="选择此列" contenteditable="false"></div><div class="row-select-btn" data-row="0" title="选择此行" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">药剂</span></th><th tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="column-select-btn" data-col="1" title="选择此列" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​使用浓度</span></th><th tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="column-select-btn" data-col="2" title="选择此列" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​优势</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="row-select-btn" data-row="1" title="选择此行" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">25%吡唑醚菌酯</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​2000倍</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​提升叶绿素，延缓衰老</span></td></tr><tr><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="row-select-btn" data-row="2" title="选择此行" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">三唑酮</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​1500倍</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​速效性强，3天控粉层</span></td></tr><tr><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="row-select-btn" data-row="3" title="选择此行" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​腈菌唑</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​4000倍</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​内吸传导，持效期长</span></td></tr><tr><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><div class="row-select-btn" data-row="4" title="选择此行" contenteditable="false"></div><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​枯草芽孢杆菌</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​1000倍</span></td><td tabindex="0" contenteditable="false"><span class="edit-area" contenteditable="true">​生物防治，花期安全</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>避免高温时喷三唑酮（防药害），生物制剂需提前7天使用</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
