<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>又称柑橘褐斑病、柑橘棒孢霉叶斑病、柑橘棒孢霉斑病。病害主要发生在叶上，也侵染当年生成熟嫩梢和果实。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片：初期褐色圆形病斑，边缘隆起，中央凹陷，周围有黄色晕圈。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实：幼果期出现油渍状斑点，后期病斑木栓化。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片病斑：圆形或不正圆形，大小 3～17mm，一般 5～8mm。发病初期叶面散生浅色小圆点，后渐扩大，形成穿透叶两面、边缘略隆起深褐色、中部凹陷黄褐至灰褐色的典型病斑，外缘具明显黄色晕环。一张叶上常出现病斑一至数个，少数叶多达十余个。天气潮湿多雨时，病部长出黄褐色霉丛（病原分生孢子梗和孢子），病部黑腐霉烂；气温高时，叶渐卷曲，重病叶大量焦枯脱落。因品种不同，症状表现程度有差异。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实和梢部病斑：近圆形，褐色内凹，大小 2～4mm，外缘微隆起，周围无明显黄色晕圈。果上病斑较光滑，木栓化龟裂程度小或不裂开，隆起度无溃疡病斑突出，中部凹区较宽坦。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0032', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '31', '
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="italic">Corynespora citricola</span><span>，属真菌界无性态子囊菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>分生孢子梗丛生于子座上，子座由假柔膜组织融结成，不规则圆形或球形，深褐色，大小 30～90μm。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>孢子梗顶端孔生出分生孢子，分生孢子脱落后孢梗之端部另长出一小节再孔生出孢子；在 PDA 培养基上菌丝埋生于基物内，外生菌丝分枝多。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>越冬与侵染：病菌以菌丝体或分生孢子梗在坏死组织越冬，暖热地区分生孢子也可越冬。次年春季从叶面气孔侵入繁殖，8~9 月出现大量病斑，新病斑产生分生孢子重复侵染，叶内潜育或形成小病斑越冬，翌年 4~5 月再次形成为害高峰。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病影响因素：干燥气候发病轻，雨日多、橘园通风透光差、修剪不好则发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种与树龄差异：常见品种均会被侵染，橙类发病相对较重，橘类次之，柚类偶见；老年树重于幼树，春梢及成熟叶片重于夏、秋梢和嫩叶。一般不会造成严重灾害，但需关注监测。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>风雨传播：雨水飞溅是主要传播方式，病菌可随气流扩散至邻近果园。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农事操作：修剪工具、采摘人员接触带菌组织后传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>一、农业防治（基础预防，减少病源）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>核心是通过田间管理培育壮树，从根本提升柑橘自身抗病能力，具体措施如下：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>日常管理：科学用水用肥，合理修剪枝条，保持橘园通风透光，避免病菌滋生环境。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冬季清园：彻底清理园内病枝、落叶和残果，减少越冬的病菌与虫卵基数。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土壤与排灌：增施有机质肥改善土壤肥力，同时疏通排灌系统，避免园内积水诱发病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>重病园处理：若果园病害严重，可采取高接换种或直接改种抗病品种的方式，从源头解决问题。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>二、化学防治（针对性控病，分药剂类型）</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>按 “保护性杀菌剂→内吸性药剂→其他推荐药剂” 分类，同时明确喷药关键原则，避免盲目用药。</span></div>
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 保护性杀菌剂（以预防为主，提前建立防护）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>80% 代森锰锌可湿性粉剂：使用浓度为 600 倍液，需在雨前喷施，能在叶片表面形成保护膜，持效期 10-15 天，还可兼防多种真菌病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>70% 丙森锌可湿性粉剂：使用浓度为 500 倍液，适合幼果期使用，其中的锌离子能增强叶片自身抗病力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 内吸性药剂（发病初期使用，侧重治疗）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2% 春雷霉素水剂 + 77% 氢氧化铜可湿性粉剂：需在发病初期喷施，兼具内吸治疗和表面保护双重作用，对病害的防效可达 85% 以上。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3. 其他推荐药剂（发病初期可选，按需使用）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% 异菌脲可湿性粉剂：1000 倍液，发病初期喷洒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>60% 唑醚・代森联水分散粒剂：1000 倍液，发病初期喷洒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>60% 戊唑醇・丙森锌可湿性粉剂：1500 倍液，发病初期喷洒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>75% 肟菌・戊唑醇水分散粒剂：3000 倍液，发病初期喷洒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>45% 咪鲜胺微乳剂：1000-1200 倍液，发病期使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>10% 苯醚甲环唑水分散粒剂：按产品说明稀释，发病期使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>80% 大生 M-45 可湿性粉剂：500-600 倍液，发病期使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% 戊唑醇水乳剂 + 70% 丙森锌可湿性粉剂：前者 1000-1500 倍液与后者 600-800 倍液混合使用，可增强防效。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% 吡唑醚菌酯：1000-1500 倍液，发病期使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>4. 喷药关键注意事项（核心原则，必须遵守）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>及时喷药：感病品种在春芽显露 0.5~1cm 时喷第一次药，间隔 7~10 天喷第二次；下雨前后需抓紧补喷，避免雨水冲刷降低药效。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选准药剂：优先选择上述针对性药剂，不使用无效或低效药剂，避免浪费成本且延误防治时机。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮换与混合：不同类型药剂需轮换使用（防止病菌产生耐药性），必要时按说明混合使用（如戊唑醇搭配丙森锌），进一步提升防效。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
