    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实：近地面果实先发病，初为淡灰色圆斑，逐渐变暗，不凹陷、革质有韧性，指压不破；软腐后有刺鼻味道，高温高湿时病部生稀疏白霉层。或表皮出现污褐色至褐灰色圆形斑，迅速蔓延全果，有强烈皂臭味；干燥时质地坚韧，高温时长白色绒毛菌丝</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>树体：发病轻时叶色黄化、果实早黄皮厚；严重时枝干叶脉褪绿呈黄褐色，叶黄落、枝干枯，开花多落果早，残留果小早黄味酸苦；病斑环绕枝干则植株越冬后死亡。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片：受害生浅色水渍状圆形斑，伴白色稀疏菌丝</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>由多种疫霉菌引起，主要包括柑橘褐腐疫霉（</span><span class="italic">Phytophthoracitriophthora</span><span>）等，国内报道分离的病原真菌共12种，以前5种（腐皮镰孢、寄生疫霉、柑橘褐腐疫霉、德氏腐霉、逸见腐霉）最常见且为害重</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>越冬：疫霉菌以菌丝体、厚垣孢子或卵孢子，镰孢霉菌以菌丝体或厚垣孢子在根颈部病组织或土壤病残体中越冬。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播：雨水传播孢子囊/游动孢子（疫霉）或分生孢子（镰孢霉），从伤口或衰弱处侵入根颈部或近地面果实；贮运期病果可接触传病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件：结果期阴雨连绵、偏施氮肥、树冠下部果实病重；越成熟果实越易感病；高温高湿（雨后暴晴）利于发病；地窖贮藏较通风库病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>用枳、枸头橙等抗病砧木，提高嫁接口；避免甜橙/红橘作砧木（高水位/密植园）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清园除病果，贮藏初期剔烂果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>开沟排水，忌间种高秆作物；定植不深（嫁接口外露），增施有机肥，防树干受伤；及时治天牛。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>采收前1个月喷25%甲霜灵500倍液2次；采收后用25%甲霜灵600倍液或80%代森锰锌600-800倍液处理。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病树刮除病组织（加0.5-1.0cm健康组织），涂1:1:10波尔多液/3%硫酸铜液/25%甲霜灵500倍液，包扎；重病树靠接抗病实生苗。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
