    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">增施有机肥</span><span>：每亩年施羊粪 2000kg + 硼砂 2kg，提升土壤有机质至 2% 以上，有效硼含量提高至 0.8mg/kg。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">砧木选择</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>优先选用枳壳、枸头橙等耐缺硼砧木，嫁接部位高于地面 10cm 以上。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
