    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">作用机制</span><span>：补充土壤有效硼，持效期 6-8 个月。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">使用技术</span><span>：秋季基肥中每亩混施硼砂 1-2kg，与有机肥拌匀后沟施。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
