<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>柑橘缺镁症</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>规律：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">植株表现</span><span>：镁是叶绿素核心成分，缺镁先从老叶开始（镁可移动，优先供应新叶），叶片沿中脉两侧出现黄化斑块，叶脉仍保持绿色，严重时黄化区扩大至全叶，仅叶尖、叶缘残留绿色，最终叶片脱落，新梢生长受抑制。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">土壤因素</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>酸性土壤（pH＜5.5）中，镁易被氢离子置换流失，或被铝、锰离子拮抗，导致根系吸收受阻（砂质土、红壤区常见）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>砂质土壤保肥能力差，多雨季节镁元素淋溶严重，易引发缺镁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>过量施用钾肥、钙肥时，钾、钙离子与镁离子竞争吸收位点，抑制镁的吸收（如长期偏施氯化钾、过磷酸钙的果园）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">气候与管理</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>干旱时根系吸水吸肥能力下降，镁吸收受阻；积水时根系缺氧，吸收功能紊乱，加重缺镁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>结果过多的树体，镁向果实转移量大，叶片中镁含量不足，易表现缺素症状（柚类、脐橙等结果量大的品种更敏感）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
