  </div>');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0037', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '36', '
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">基肥中配合施用镁肥</span><span>：每株成年树施硫酸镁 0.5-1 公斤（或氧化镁 0.3-0.5 公斤、硝酸镁 0.4-0.8 公斤），与有机肥混合施用，提高吸收效率。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">控制钾肥、钙肥用量</span><span>：避免过量施用氯化钾、硫酸钾（每亩年用量不超过 50 公斤）和过磷酸钙，采用平衡肥（如 15-15-15 复合肥），减少离子竞争。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">水分管理</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>保持土壤湿润但不积水，干旱时及时灌水（采用滴灌、喷灌，避免大水漫灌），雨季及时排水，防止根系受损。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>以 “叶面喷施快速补充 + 土壤基施长效维持” 为核心，优先叶面喷施（见效快，3-7 天可见效），结合土壤补肥巩固效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 叶面喷施药剂（按效果及使用频次排序）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">硫酸镁</span><span>：最常用且高效，浓度 0.5%-1%（即 100 斤水加 0.5-1 斤硫酸镁），叶片正反面均匀喷施，间隔 7-10 天 1 次，连续 2-3 次。可单独使用，或与 0.3% 尿素混合喷施（促进吸收），对老叶黄化修复效果显著。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">硝酸镁</span><span>：含氮和镁，既能补镁又能补氮，适合缺镁伴随轻度缺氮的树体，浓度 0.4%-0.8%，用法同硫酸镁，在春梢、秋梢生长期喷施效果佳。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">螯合镁</span><span>（EDTA 镁）：吸收率高于无机镁，尤其在酸性土壤中不易被拮抗，浓度 0.1%-0.2%，喷施后 1-2 天即可被叶片吸收，适合应急补充，成本较高，常用于严重缺镁树体。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">氯化镁</span><span>：效果与硫酸镁接近，但含氯离子，对柑橘（尤其敏感品种如温州蜜柑）需控制浓度（≤0.5%），避免氯离子积累导致毒害，使用频次较低。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span> </span><span class="bold">氨基酸镁 / 腐植酸镁</span><span>：有机螯合态镁，与氨基酸、腐植酸协同作用，提高镁的稳定性和吸收率，浓度 0.2%-0.3%，适合长期调理，改善树体营养状况。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 土壤施用药剂</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">硫酸镁</span><span>：成年树每株施 0.5-1.5 公斤，幼树 0.2-0.5 公斤，在树冠滴水线处开浅沟施入，覆土后浇水，结合雨季前施用，减少淋溶损失。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span> </span><span class="bold">白云石粉（碳酸镁钙</span><span>）：缓慢释放镁元素，适合酸性土壤长期调理，每亩 150-200 公斤，与有机肥混合施入，有效期 1-2 年。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span> </span><span class="bold">镁肥复合肥</span><span>：选用含镁的复合肥（如 16-8-16-2MgO），在春梢、秋梢期追肥，每株 0.5-1 公斤，平衡氮磷钾与镁的供应。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>柑橘缺锌症</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">土壤因素</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">碱性土壤</span><span>：锌以氢氧化物形式沉淀，有效锌含量＜0.5mg/kg。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">高磷土壤</span><span>：磷酸锌溶解度降低，吸收受阻。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">症状表现</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">叶片</span><span>：新梢叶尖出现肋骨状黄色斑块，主脉及附近保持绿色，称 “绿肋黄化症”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">果实</span><span>：果小皮厚，畸形果率增加 20%-30%。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
