  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>常见原因：浓度过高（如石硫合剂在幼果期使用）、混配不当（如波尔多液与碱性农药混用）、高温施药。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>严格按说明书配药，避免中午高温施药，不同药剂间隔 7 天以上使用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>新药试用前进行小范围试验，避免敏感品种受害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>补救措施：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>立即用清水冲洗植株，喷施叶面肥（0.3% 尿素 + 0.2% 磷酸二氢钾）缓解症状。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>石硫合剂药害可用 400-500 倍食醋中和，波尔多液药害喷施 0.5%-1% 石灰水。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>肥害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状：根系褐变腐烂，地上部叶片边缘焦枯，新梢生长停滞，严重时植株死亡。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
