  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（四）桃蛀螟</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">症状表现</span><span>：幼虫蛀果危害，先在果面啃食成小坑，后蛀入果内取食果肉和种子，虫道内充满粪便，果面蛀孔外排黄褐色黏粪；受害果易腐烂脱落，严重时一个果内有多头幼虫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发生规律</span><span>：一年 3-4 代，老熟幼虫在树皮缝、杂草、秸秆中越冬，成虫昼伏夜出，产卵于果实萼洼、梗洼处，5-9 月为幼虫危害期，早熟品种、果实套袋不及时果园重发。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">预防方法</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冬季清园烧毁杂草秸秆，春季挂桃蛀螟性诱剂（每亩 5 个）诱杀成虫；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实膨大期及时套袋，套袋前喷药杀灭卵和初孵幼虫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
