    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（八）金龟子（铜绿丽金龟、暗黑鳃金龟）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">症状表现</span><span>：成虫啃食叶片，造成叶片缺刻、孔洞，严重时将叶片吃光；成虫也啃食果实，在果面形成不规则凹陷斑，引发果实腐烂；幼虫（蛴螬）在土壤中啃食根系，导致根系腐烂，树体生长衰弱。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </d');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0064', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '63', 'iv>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发生规律</span><span>：一年 1 代，幼虫在土壤中越冬，成虫 5-7 月羽化，傍晚活动取食，趋光性强；果园周边有荒地、草丛时虫源多，沙质土壤、有机质丰富的果园幼虫危害重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">预防方法</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冬季翻耕土壤，冻死越冬幼虫；成虫期安装黑光灯（每亩 1 盏）诱杀，或放置糖醋液（红糖 3 份 + 醋 6 份 + 白酒 1 份 + 水 10 份 + 敌百虫 0.5 份）诱杀；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>避免果园周边种植花生、大豆等易招金龟子的作物。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">防治药剂</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>幼虫防治：春季土壤解冻后，每亩撒施 5% 辛硫磷颗粒剂 2-3kg + 细土拌匀，翻耕入土；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>成虫防治：成虫危害期喷 5% 高效氯氟氰菊酯乳油 1500 倍液、20% 氰戊菊酯乳油 2000 倍液，傍晚喷施效果佳，间隔 7 天，连喷 2 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
