INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0065', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '64', '须根少，树势逐年衰弱，严重时 3-5 年枯死。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发生规律</span><span>：病毒主要借嫁接传播，无昆虫传播记录，带毒接穗是主要传播途径，高温环境（30℃以上）会加重症状，幼树比成年树易感病，管理粗放、肥水不足果园发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">预防方法</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>严格选用无病毒接穗和苗木，禁止从病园采集接穗；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强肥水管理，每年施有机肥（每亩 3000kg）+ 复合肥（每亩 50kg），避免树体衰弱。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
