  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要为害嫩枝、芽，严重时整株死亡：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>嫩枝：形成褐色病斑并扩展，导致嫩枝枯死，后期嫩枝褪色变白；病斑处产生大量分生孢子器，潮湿时溢出分生孢子角；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>芽：受侵染后变褐坏死；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>内部组织：剖开受害组织，皮层稍变黄，维管束、木质部和髓部组成的中柱部分变为褐色，且褐色从外向内逐渐变淡</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">二、病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌为乌饭树拟茎点霉（</span><span class="italic">Phomopsis vaccinii</span><span>），是越橘间座壳（</span><span class="italic">Diaporthe vaccinii</span><span>）的无性阶段，属子囊菌门间座壳科；分生孢子器产生两种孢子：甲型无色单胞卵圆形（有油球可萌发），乙型无色单胞线形（钩状无油球不可萌发</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">三、发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：主要通过雨水传播，由花芽侵入植株；枝条有伤口时，可与导致蓝莓枝干溃疡的葡萄座腔菌复合侵染；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>侵染周期：周期长，连续侵染下蓝莓可整株死亡；还可能侵染果实和叶片</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
