  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冬季彻底清除病枝落叶，减少越冬菌源；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>花芽开放前清除病枝，喷洒波尔多液预防；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生长季及时清除病残体，防治刺吸式口器害虫；喷施钙肥2-3次，合理灌溉施肥；冬季防寒减少冻伤；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：喷施25%吡唑醚菌酯乳油1800倍液或24%腈苯唑悬浮剂1500倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
