    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要由绿色头孢藻等藻类引起；或参考假尾孢菌（</span><span class="italic">Pseudocercospora psidi</span><span>）（具体病原可参考荔枝、龙眼藻斑病）</span></div>
    
    
    
