<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发病特征</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片：初期为不规则形、边缘模糊的黑色坏死病斑（直径 3~5 mm）；高温高湿时病斑快速扩展（1~2 天内蔓延至整张叶片），叶片焦枯脱落（“叶枯型”）；干旱时病斑扩展缓慢，形成褐色枯死斑，周围变黄（“叶斑型”）。保湿后病斑上会产生橘黄色分生孢子堆。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实：仅形成直径 1~2 mm 的圆形凹陷斑，周围有红色晕圈，自然条件下极少产孢（与典型炭疽病不同）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种差异</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要危害嘎啦、金冠、乔纳金、秦冠等品种，富士、红星、元帅等高度抗病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>流行规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌以菌丝体在病僵果、干枝、果台越冬，5 月产生分生孢子，借雨水 / 昆虫传播，经皮孔 / 伤口侵入，潜育期短（仅需 2 小时保湿即可侵染）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病高峰在 7~8 月连续阴雨期，高温（28~32℃）高湿条件下易暴发，可多次侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清园：秋季落叶后及春季萌芽前，彻底清扫病叶、病果，刮除枝干病斑并销毁，减少越冬菌源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果园管理：起垄栽培、生草覆盖（改良环境），雨季及时排水，避免积水；合理修剪，改善通风透光。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>抗病品种：新建果园优先选择富士等抗病品种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">化学防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>唑醚·氟唑菌酰胺最有效，其次吡唑醚菌酯或克菌丹+亚磷酸钾</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>关键时期：6 月雨季前至 9 月，每月喷施 1 次波尔多液（持效期 15 天以上，雨季首选）；两次波尔多液之间可穿插吡唑醚菌酯（1500 倍液，兼具保护和内吸治疗作用）、代森锰锌（500 倍液）等药剂。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>具体节点：萌芽前：喷施 3~5 波美度石硫合剂或 100~200 倍硫酸铜液，铲除越冬病菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>雨季来临前：提前喷施波尔多液，确保每次阴雨期叶片和果实有药剂保护。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期：若错过波尔多液，可选用吡唑醚菌酯（24 小时内用药，治疗效果 70%）或咪鲜胺（60%）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
