<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>一、典型病症</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>初期：枝梢少量叶片失水青枯、无光泽，逐步转为红褐色干枯，病叶多紧贴枝条不易脱落，常单侧枝梢先发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>中期：病害沿枝条蔓延，整根新梢 / 结果枝枯死，剥开皮层可见木质部维管束变褐，有褐色条斑。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>后期：病枝向大枝、主干扩展，局部枝组或整株枯死，高湿环境下病部可产生白色霉状病菌孢子。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>二、发生原因</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：核心为拟盘多毛孢类真菌，病菌在病枝、病落叶中越冬，是初次侵染源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播：借风雨、昆虫、修剪工具扩散，从剪口、虫口、冻裂伤口等侵入，堵塞枝梢输导组织，导致水分养分输送中断。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>诱发条件：挂果过量、养分不足致树势衰弱；土壤积水黏重、根系腐烂；土壤严重酸化；修剪过重伤口多；偏施氮肥。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>三、预防措施</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>强健树势：合理疏果控产，增施有机肥与磷钾肥，补充硼、锌中微量元素，忌偏施氮肥。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <di');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0072', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '71', 'v class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>减少菌源：冬季彻底清园，剪除病弱枝、枯死枝并集中烧毁，喷施 3-5 波美度石硫合剂封园。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>田间管护：疏通排水沟避免积水，树盘覆草调温保湿；修剪工具及时消毒，大剪口涂抹杀菌剂保护。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>调酸改土：土壤 pH＜5.5 时，适量撒施生石灰调节土壤酸度，提升根系活力与抗病性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>四、防治方案</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>彻底清病梢：发现病梢立即剪除，剪口需延伸至病部下方 20cm 的健康枝条处，病枝全部带出果园销毁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防控：发病初期全树均匀喷雾，可选 30% 苯甲・丙环唑 2000 倍液、75% 肟菌・戊唑醇 3000 倍液或 70% 甲基硫菌灵 800 倍液，或使用井冈霉素+噻呋酰胺，间隔 7-10 天 1 次，连喷 2-3 次，枝梢、叶片正反面均需喷透。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根部辅助：根部淋施恶霉灵 + 生根剂，修复根系活力，增强树体抗病能力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>大枝处理：主干 / 大枝发病时，刮除病部皮层，涂抹咪鲜胺或噻霉酮药剂封闭伤口。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.1.19甘蔗</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>甘蔗红壳病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
