<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状：该病主要为害叶片。 病斑呈圆形或近圆形， 边缘呈黑褐色或深色， 中央呈灰白色或白色 病斑背面与正面症状相差不大， 中间有时穿孔。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor"');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0074', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '73', ' ><span>病原菌为辣椒叶点霉（Phyllosticta capsici），主要以分生孢子器在病残体上、混在种子间或潜伏在种子内部越冬。当温度处于 25 - 30℃、相对湿度高于 80% 时，分生孢子器吸水，分生孢子逸出，借风雨传播，从辣椒植株的伤口或气孔侵入，完成初侵染。此后，病部产生新分生孢子，持续借助风雨、昆虫等媒介传播，反复进行再侵染。种植过密致使通风透光不佳、田间湿度长时间偏高，以及偏施氮肥造成植株生长过旺、组织柔弱、抗性降低的情况，再结合温暖潮湿的气候环境，会显著加剧病害发生与蔓延，发病高峰期多在辣椒生长中后期。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择：依据当地气候特点、病害流行状况，精心挑选对白星病抗性优良的辣椒品种，从根源增强植株抗病潜能。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种植管理：按照品种特性与土壤肥力，科学规划种植密度，保证每亩种植 3000 - 4000 株，优化田间通风透光条件，降低湿度；秉持平衡施肥理念，增施有机肥、磷钾肥，严格把控氮肥施用量，强化植株自身抵御病害能力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>田园清理：定期巡查田园，及时摘除并清理病叶、病果、病株，带出田外集中深埋或烧毁，最大程度减少病原菌越冬和初侵染源头；收获结束后，全面深耕翻土，深埋病原菌，削弱其存活能力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理：播种前，可运用 55℃温水浸种 15 - 20 分钟，或采用种子重量 0.3% 的 50% 多菌灵可湿性粉剂拌种操作，有效杀灭种子内外可能潜藏的病原菌，保障种子 “健康” 下种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷雾：发病伊始，抓紧选用 70% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲基硫菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 800 - 1000 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液、80% </span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液等杀菌剂开展喷雾作业，着重喷施叶片正反两面、茎秆等部位，每隔 7 - 10 天喷施 1 次，接连喷施 2 - 3 次，且注意交替轮换用药，规避病原菌产生抗药性问题。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茬口轮作：提倡与非茄科蔬菜隔年轮作，以减少田间病菌来源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理：合理密植，深沟高畦栽培，雨后及时排水，降低地下水位，适当增施磷钾肥，促使植株健壮，提高植株抗病能力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清洁田园：及时摘除病、老叶，收获后清除病残体，带出田外深埋或烧毁，深翻土壤，加速病残体的腐烂分解。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治措施：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷雾防治：在发病初期开始喷药，每隔7-10天喷1次，连续喷2-3次。可选用以下药剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>80%新万生（</span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>）可湿性粉剂800倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>80%山德生（</span><span class="text-color-green">丙森锌</span><span>）可湿性粉剂600-800倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50%托布津（</span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>）可湿性粉剂1000倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>77%可杀得（</span><span class="text-color-green">氢氧化铜</span><span>）可湿性粉剂1000倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>75%</span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂600倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50%</span><span class="text-color-green">琥胶肥酸铜</span><span>可湿性粉剂500倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25%阿米西达（</span><span class="text-color-green">丙环唑</span><span>）悬浮液1500倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25%</span><span class="text-color-green">啶氧菌酯</span><span>悬浮剂1000倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50%消菌灵（</span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>）可湿性粉剂1500-2000倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50%异菌脲悬浮剂1000倍液</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>熏烟防治：保护地密闭时可用烟剂一号熏烟，每亩350克。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉病（Leveillula taurica）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
    <li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_d4cc460d-5bc3-4c8e-959f-83ecfcd694ad.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌丝体或闭囊壳在病残体上越冬，适宜温度（20 - 25℃）、相对湿度 70% 左右且田间通风透光不良时，分生孢子借气流传播，反复侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选用抗病品种，合理密植，保持良好通风透光条件，增施有机肥及磷钾肥，增强植株抗性，及时清理病残株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用 25% 粉锈宁（三唑酮）可湿性粉剂 1500 - 2000 倍液、10% 苯醚甲环唑水分散粒剂 800 - 1000 倍液等喷雾，7 - 10 天 1 次，连喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>不同辣椒品种对白粉病抗性各异，应依据当地实际种植情形与病害发生态势，审慎挑选抗病、耐病品种，像壮椒 2008、满丰二号等，以此从根源处降低发病风险，筑牢防病 “第一道防线”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理密植：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>按科学规划，建议亩栽苗 2000 - 2200 颗，采用 1.2 米畦面实施单垄栽培，株距把控在 20 - 25 公分，优先选取高垄栽培模式。鉴于根系生长对温室环境、光照、氧气、水分等条件要求严苛，高垄栽培在浇水后可保障土壤具备优良通透性，强化保温效能，优化植株生长根基条件，削减因种植过密、通风透光不佳滋生白粉病的隐患。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理给水给肥：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉病病原菌滋生繁衍与环境温湿度紧密关联，高温高湿是发病 “温床”，且干湿交替恰是其孢子萌发、再侵染的 “便利契机”。故而在水分管理上，不可盲目过度控水，特别是秋季高温阶段，不能单纯为抑制秧苗旺长而克扣水分，应维持土壤 “见干见湿” 状态，同步把控棚室内空气湿度处于合理区间，规避湿度大幅波动助长病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清洁田园：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在辣椒生长全程，需强化田园巡查管护，及时摘除病叶、老叶，减少病原菌栖息繁衍 “据点”。待收获完毕，彻底清除田间病残体，严谨带出田外并深埋或付之一炬，同时对土壤开展深翻作业，加速病残体腐解，破坏病原菌越冬、潜藏 “避风港”，最大程度压低来年发病 “基数”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治措施：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷雾防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病害防治关键在 “早”，发病初期就得火速行动，启动药剂喷雾作业，以 7 - 10 天为间隔周期，连贯喷施 2 - 3 次。可按需选用下列高效药剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>三唑类杀菌剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% 粉锈宁（</span><span class="text-color-green">三唑酮</span><span>）可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液，有效成分三唑酮通过抑制病原菌麦角甾醇合成，干扰其细胞膜构建，遏制菌丝生长与孢子形成，直击病害 “要害”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>10% </span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂 800 - 1000 倍液，核心成分苯醚甲环唑抑制真菌细胞色素 P450 酶活性，阻断麦角甾醇合成路径，致使细胞膜结构崩坏，强效抑菌杀菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡唑嘧菌酯</span><span>乳油 2500 倍液，吡唑嘧菌酯属甲氧基丙烯酸酯类，作用于病原菌呼吸链，抑制线粒体呼吸进程，“釜底抽薪” 式阻碍病原菌能量代谢与繁衍。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>其他高效杀菌剂：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0075', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '74', '
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>30% 特富灵（</span><span class="text-color-green">氟菌唑</span><span>）可湿性粉剂 1500 - 2000 倍液，主要成分氟菌唑为咪唑类，借抑制麦角甾醇合成，让病原菌 “失能”，防控病害蔓延。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>40% </span><span class="text-color-green">多硫</span><span>悬浮剂 500 倍液，主含多</span><span class="text-color-green">硫化钡与硫磺</span><span>，施药后释放硫元素，以其氧化性与腐蚀性破坏病原菌细胞结构，施展杀菌威力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>42.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">肟菌酯・氟吡菌酰胺</span><span> 1500 - 3000 倍液，</span><span class="text-color-green">肟菌酯</span><span>（甲氧基丙烯酸酯类）作用呼吸链，</span><span class="text-color-green">氟吡菌酰胺</span><span>作为琥珀酸脱氢酶抑制剂，二者 “强强联手”，兼具防护、治疗、铲除多重功效，瓦解病原菌生理机能。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>70% </span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 800 倍液，主要成分代森锰锌于植株表面 “披覆” 防护膜，恰似 “盾牌” 阻挡病原菌侵入。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 倍液，核心成分百菌清与病原菌细胞酶结合，搅乱其代谢流程，广谱抵御病害侵袭。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>熏烟防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>处于保护地栽培场景且环境密闭时，可启用熏烟处置，如</span><span class="text-color-green">霜霉威、百菌清</span><span>等烟雾剂，按每亩 350 克用量规范操作，借烟雾弥漫均匀覆盖，高效触杀病原菌，强化防治成效，尤适用于病害初现或局部发生阶段。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治措施：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拮抗微生物利用：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病伊始，可调配 2% 武夷菌素水剂 200 倍液开展喷雾防治，凭借其中有益微生物拮抗机制，抑制白粉病病原菌生长繁衍，按 7 天间隔规律施药，持续作业 2～3 次，以温和、环保手段 “制衡” 病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物源杀菌剂应用：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在苗期精准喷施碧护 3 克 + 碧欧 30 克，借助植物源制剂营养调节与抑菌功效，稳固幼苗生长态势、强化抗性，间隔 20 天再次喷施，防范秧苗徒长同时，赋予植株抵御白粉病 “底气”，为辣椒健康生长全程 “护航”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病（Botrytis cinerea）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
