    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% </span><span class="text-color-green">嘧菌酯悬浮剂</span><span> 1000 倍液：嘧菌酯属甲氧基丙烯酸酯类，靶向病菌呼吸链，阻断能量代谢，集保护、治疗、铲除功效于一体，防控疫病效果突出。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3% </span><span class="text-co');
