    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根腐分为三种：腐霉根腐、疫霉根腐、镰刀根腐三种</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>其中镰刀根腐引起根系褐变，病原是腐皮镰孢 [Fusarium solani （Mart. ） App. et Wollenw]，属半知菌门真菌</span></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
    <li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_d17090b9-3b1d-4eb8-adac-d7a874c6cdb8.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病原菌在土壤中存活，随流水、农事操作等传播，从根部伤口侵入，土壤黏重、排水不良、连作地块，在 25 - 30℃易发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：与非茄科蔬菜轮作，改良土壤，增施有机肥和生物菌肥，高垄栽培，利于排水。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用 50% 多菌灵可湿性粉剂 500 倍液灌根，每株灌药液 200 - 300 毫升，或用甲霜灵・锰锌可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液灌根。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作换茬：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>极力避免与瓜类、茄果类蔬菜连作，积极提倡与十字花科、豆科等蔬菜开展轮作安排。鉴于根腐病病原菌易在土壤中长期存活、积累，轮作能有效打破其生存循环，稀释病原菌 “浓度”，降低发病风险。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>践行配方施肥策略，施足腐熟有机肥，筑牢土壤肥力根基。把控氮肥用量，防止偏施 “催长” 氮肥致植株虚胖、抗性下滑，适当增施磷钾肥，强化植株 “筋骨”。苗期稳施氮肥 “助长”，开花结果期侧重追施磷钾肥，并适时补充叶面肥，保障植株营养均衡、茁壮抵御病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>播种前借助 “三步曲” 净化种子。先是温汤浸种，将水温调至 55 - 60℃，浸泡 15 分钟，给种子来场 “热浴杀菌”；接着用 10% 磷酸三钠浸种 30 分钟，深度 “消杀” 种表病菌；再用 72.2% 普力克水剂（</span><span class="text-color-green">霜霉威盐酸盐</span><span>） 600 - 800 倍液浸种 12 小时，多管齐下，洗净催芽播种，最大程度剔除种表病菌及病毒 “隐患”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>苗床与土壤处理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>育苗前精心筹备 “净土” 苗床，优先选用 2 年未种过茄果类的大田土或葱蒜地土，按每平方米 10 克用量撒施 120 抗菌剂或多菌灵开展消毒作业，播种时讲究药土 “上下呵护”，即下铺、上盖。亦或每平方米用 5% </span><span class="text-color-green">丙烯酸・恶霉・甲霜灵</span><span>水剂 2 - 3 毫升稀释至 1000 - 1500 倍喷洒苗床，密织 “防护网”，严防幼苗 “带病上岗”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>秉持 “预防为先” 理念，带药定植。一旦发现中心病株，果断拔除，火速启动 “喷施、灌根、熏蒸” 组合拳。可选用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">瑞毒铜</span><span> （有效成分主要是</span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵与琥胶肥酸铜</span><span>复配，</span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵</span><span>针对卵菌纲，</span><span class="text-color-green">琥胶肥酸铜</span><span>有广谱杀菌特性）1000 倍液或</span><span class="text-color-green">绿乳铜</span><span> 800 - 1000 倍液喷雾防控；也能用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜铜</span><span> 500 倍液、64% </span><span class="text-color-green">瑞毒铝铜</span><span> 250 倍液开展防治作业，每 7 - 10 天施药 1 次，连施 2 - 3 次。同时，优先考虑烟熏法（用 45% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清烟雾剂</span><span> 250 - 300 克 / 亩）或粉尘法（5% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清粉尘剂</span><span> 1 千克 / 亩），7 天左右操作 1 次，持续 2 - 3 次，借烟雾、粉尘弥漫全方位 “围剿” 病菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灌根预防：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>辣椒定植后，瞅准坐果前时机 “主动出击” 预防病害。选阳光满溢的晴天上午，将</span><span class="text-color-green">硫酸铜</span><span>晶体或 120 抗菌剂按每亩 1 - 2 千克用量随水浇灌，若添入活性生根剂，恰似 “如虎添翼”，强化根系活力与防病能力。把控水量，不超垄高 2/3，浇灌后及时通风换气，谨防叶部病害 “趁乱作祟”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>善用</span><span class="text-color-green">多粘类芽孢杆菌制剂</span><span>等生物制剂，这类有益微生物入驻土壤或根际周边后，宛如 “微观卫士”，凭借自身代谢产出多种抗菌物质，有的能 “破壁” 病原菌细胞，有的干扰其代谢路径，多维度制衡辣椒根腐病病原菌，践行绿色、长效防治之道。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>菌核病（Sclerotinia sclerotiorum）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
    <li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_317b6758-fd94-4676-f611-dd17b145d854.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
<li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_4658c0c0-e51c-4803-e293-6ba6c7e6d8df.png"
      style="width: 265px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
<li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_10af2809-757b-4f8c-cb70-ff5b9d336e30.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：菌核在土壤或病残体越冬，15 - 20℃、湿度大时，菌核萌发产生子囊盘和子囊孢子，借气流、雨水传播，从衰弱组织或伤口侵入。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：深翻土壤，使菌核埋深，轮作倒茬，及时清除病残体，保持田间清洁。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土壤消毒</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在种植前，对土壤进行消毒处理。可以使用 40% </span><span class="text-color-green">五氯硝基苯粉剂与福美双</span><span>可湿性粉剂按照 1:1 混合，每平方米用药 8 - 10 克，拌细土撒施；或者用 70% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲基硫菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂或 50% 多菌灵可湿性粉剂，每平方米 8 - 10 克，与细土混合后撒施，能有效减少土壤中的菌核数量。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bull');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0077', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '76', 'et-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷雾防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在发病初期，可选用以下药剂进行喷雾防治，每隔 7 - 10 天喷 1 次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>40% </span><span class="text-color-green">菌核净</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：菌核净主要成分是 N - （3,5 - 二氯苯基）丁二酰亚胺，它能干扰病原菌的细胞分裂和呼吸作用，抑制菌核的萌发和菌丝生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：异菌脲的主要成分是 3 - （3,5 - 二氯苯基） - 1 - 异丙基氨基甲酰基乙内酰脲，可抑制病原菌的蛋白激酶，阻止病菌孢子萌发和菌丝生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：腐霉利主要成分是 N - （3,5 - 二氯苯基） - 1,2 - 二甲基环丙烷 - 1,2 - 二甲酰亚胺，通过抑制病原菌的有丝分裂，对菌核病有良好的防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% </span><span class="text-color-green">啶菌恶唑</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液：啶菌恶唑主要成分是啶菌恶唑，它能抑制病原菌的甾醇合成，破坏细胞膜结构，从而达到杀菌的目的。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>70% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲基硫菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 800 - 1000 倍液：甲基硫菌灵主要成分是甲基 - 2 - 苯并咪唑氨基甲酸酯，干扰病原菌的细胞分裂，抑制菌丝生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液：多菌灵主要成分是苯并咪唑类化合物，能抑制病原菌的细胞分裂和生长，具有内吸性，可被植株吸收传导。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>烟雾剂防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在保护地栽培中，可选用 10% </span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利烟剂</span><span>或 15% </span><span class="text-color-green">菌核净烟剂、异丙威烟剂</span><span>，每亩用量 250 - 300 克，进行熏烟防治。这些烟雾剂在保护地密闭环境中释放有效成分，能均匀地分布在空间内，通过抑制病原菌的生长和繁殖来防治菌核病，同时减少喷雾带来的湿度增加问题。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物源药剂防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>有些植物源药剂如</span><span class="text-color-green">大蒜素</span><span>，从大蒜中提取。将大蒜素制剂按照推荐浓度稀释后进行喷雾，它可以破坏病原菌的细胞膜等结构，干扰其生理功能，对菌核病有一定的防治作用，并且对环境友好，不易使病原菌产生抗药性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>微生物制剂应用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>利用</span><span class="text-color-green">木霉菌</span><span>（Trichoderma spp.）制剂进行防治。木霉菌能在土壤和植株表面定殖，与菌核病菌竞争营养和空间，并且可以分泌几丁质酶等抗菌物质分解病原菌的细胞壁，从而抑制菌核病的发生。按照产品说明将木霉菌制剂施用于土壤或植株表面。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，可选用 40% 菌核净可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液、50% 腐霉利可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液喷雾或灌根。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>辣椒枯萎病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
