    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现及原因</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>缺氮：植株生长缓慢，叶片淡绿色或黄绿色，叶片变小，薄而软。严重缺氮时，叶片发黄脱落，植株矮小。主要是因为土壤中氮素不足，或者施肥不当，如基肥中氮肥不足、追肥不及时等。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
