    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_43902566-cd3e-4a0a-f180-ed142d95559a.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>缺磷：植株矮小，叶片深绿色，无光泽，有时叶片出现紫红色斑点或条纹。磷在植物体内的移动性较强，缺磷会影响植株的能量代谢和光合作用。土壤中有效磷含量低、低温等因素会影响植株对磷的吸收。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
