<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治措施</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土壤检测与施肥调整：定期对土壤进行检测，了解土壤中各种营养元素的含量。根据检测结果，合理调整施肥方案，补充缺乏的营养元素。例如，对于缺氮的土壤，可适量增施氮肥，如尿素、碳酸氢铵等；对于缺磷的土壤，可施用过磷酸钙等磷肥。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶面喷施：在发现植株出现缺素症状时，可采用叶面喷施的方式快速补充营养元素。如缺铁时，可用 0.1% - 0.2% 的硫酸亚铁溶液叶面喷施；缺硼时，用 0.1% - 0.2% 的硼砂溶液叶面喷施；缺锌时，用 0.1% - 0.2% 的硫酸锌溶液叶面喷施。叶面喷施的时间最好选择在晴天的傍晚，以提高叶片的吸收效率。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">虫害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>烟青虫：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以蛹在土壤中越冬，成虫昼伏夜出，趋化性，将卵产在辣椒叶片、嫩茎、花蕾和果实上，幼虫孵化后蛀食果实，在 25 - 28℃、相对湿度 70% 左右繁殖快，7 - 9 月为害重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：及时清除田间杂草和残株，减少栖息场所，采用糖醋液诱捕成虫（糖：醋：酒：水 = 3:4:1:2）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：幼虫初孵期，可选用</span><span class="text-color-green">苏云金芽孢杆菌</span><span>（Bt）制剂、1.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液等喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>棉铃虫：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以蛹在土壤中越冬，成虫趋光性强，夜间活动，产卵于嫩叶、花蕾、果实等部位，幼虫先取食嫩叶后蛀食果实，在温度 25 - 28℃、相对湿度 70% 左右繁殖迅速，为害严重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：利用黑光灯诱捕成虫，清理田园周边杂草等隐蔽场所。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：幼虫孵化盛期，可选用 2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">溴氰菊酯</span><span>乳油 2000 - 3000 倍液、5% </span><span class="text-color-green">高效氯氟氰菊酯</span><span>乳油 1500 - 2000 倍液等喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蚜虫：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：在适宜温度（16 - 22℃）和湿度下繁殖力强，以卵在花椒、木槿等寄主植物上越冬，春季孵化后迁飞到辣椒上，聚集在叶片背面、嫩茎、花蕾吸食汁液。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：在田间悬挂黄色粘虫板诱杀有翅蚜，保护利用瓢虫、草蛉等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：可选用 10% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1500 - 2000 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">抗蚜威</span><span>可湿性粉剂 2000 - 3000 倍液等喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清洁田园</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>及时清除田间及周边杂草、残株和病叶，减少蚜虫的栖息地和繁殖场所。辣椒收获后，彻底清理田园，破坏蚜虫的生存环境。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理布局</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>辣椒种植地应与十字花科等蚜虫易聚集的作物保持一定距离，避免蚜虫的迁移和传播。在田间规划时，可考虑间作或轮作一些对蚜虫有驱避作用的植物。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防虫网覆盖</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="no');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0081', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '80', 'de-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在辣椒种植区域覆盖防虫网，网目以40 - 60目为宜。防虫网能有效阻止蚜虫进入田间，减少虫源。在育苗期和定植初期使用防虫网，效果更佳。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>色板诱捕</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>悬挂</span><span class="text-color-green">黄色粘虫板</span><span>诱捕蚜虫。黄色对蚜虫有很强的吸引力，每亩可悬挂20 - 30块，悬挂高度以粘虫板底部高出植株顶部10 - 20厘米为宜。定期更换粘虫板，保证诱捕效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>释放天敌</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="text-color-green">释放瓢虫、草蛉、食蚜蝇等蚜虫天敌</span><span>。例如，每平方米释放1 - 2头七星瓢虫成虫或幼虫，这些天敌可以捕食蚜虫，有效控制蚜虫种群数量。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>使用生物制剂</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>喷施植物源杀虫剂，如</span><span class="text-color-green">鱼藤酮、苦参碱</span><span>等。鱼藤酮主要成分是鱼藤酮类化合物，能抑制蚜虫的呼吸作用；苦参碱主要成分是苦参碱和氧化苦参碱，对蚜虫有触杀和胃毒作用。使用时按照产品说明进行稀释喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（四）化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷雾</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用10%</span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂1000 - 1500倍液（主要成分吡虫啉是烟碱类杀虫剂，作用于蚜虫的神经系统）、3%</span><span class="text-color-green">啶虫脒</span><span>乳油1000 - 1500倍液（啶虫脒主要成分是啶虫脒，通过与蚜虫乙酰胆碱受体结合发挥作用）、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">抗蚜威</span><span>可湿性粉剂2000 - 3000倍液（抗蚜威主要成分是抗蚜威，抑制蚜虫的胆碱酯酶活性）进行喷雾。重点喷施蚜虫聚集的叶片背面和嫩梢。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉虱：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：温室可周年发生，露地在杂草等寄主越冬，成虫趋黄性、趋嫩性，在叶片背面吸食，分泌蜜露引发煤污病，温暖干燥利于繁殖，春秋季为害重。在适宜的环境条件下（温度 20 - 28℃、相对湿度 70% 左右），从卵发育到成虫仅需 19 - 27 天。雌虫一次可产卵 100 - 200 粒，卵多产于叶片背面，呈不规则的散产</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：悬挂黄色粘虫板，保护释放丽蚜小蜂等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：合理轮作或间作非茄科蔬菜，收获后清洁田园、清除杂草残株，育苗时用防虫网防成虫飞入、消毒基质育无虫苗。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治：覆盖 40 - 60 目</span><span class="text-color-green">防虫网</span><span>与</span><span class="text-color-green">银灰色地膜</span><span>，悬挂</span><span class="text-color-green">黄色粘虫板</span><span>（每亩 30 - 40 块，底部高出植株顶部 10 - 20 厘米）诱捕成虫。网目一般为 40 - 60 目，可有效阻止白粉虱进入田间</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治：释放</span><span class="text-color-green">丽蚜小蜂</span><span>（每株 2 - 3 头，7 - 10 天释放一次，连放 3 - 4 次）、中华</span><span class="text-color-green">草蛉幼虫</span><span>（每亩 1 - 2 头）；使用</span><span class="text-color-green">印楝素、除虫菊酯</span><span>等按说明稀释喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：初期用 25% </span><span class="text-color-green">噻虫嗪</span><span>水分散粒剂 2000 - 3000 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">烯啶虫胺</span><span>水剂 1000 - 1500 倍液喷雾，严重时选 40% </span><span class="text-color-green">啶虫・毒死蜱</span><span class="bold">（在蔬菜、果树、茶叶、中草药材上不得使用）</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液，喷雾重喷叶背与植株中下部，轮换用药并遵说明施药。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：可选用 25% </span><span class="text-color-green">噻虫嗪</span><span>水分散粒剂 3000 - 5000 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">烯啶虫胺</span><span>水剂 1000 - 1500 倍液等喷雾。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茶黄螨：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：雌成螨在避风场所越冬，在 16 - 23℃、湿度适宜时，于嫩叶、嫩茎、花和果实吸食，受害叶片变厚变小，背面呈茶褐色。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：清除田间杂草和残株，减少虫源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发生初期，可选用 73% </span><span class="text-color-green">克螨特乳</span><span>油 1000 - 1500 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">浏阳霉素</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液等喷雾，重点喷植株上部。</span><span class="text-color-green">联苯肼酯</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>田园清洁：辣椒采收完毕，残株、落叶、杂草即刻清理，集中焚毁或深埋，断其 “越冬后路”、减虫源基数。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理轮作：规避连作 “陷阱”，与十字花科、豆科等非茄科蔬菜轮作，压制种群繁衍。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>精细管理：有机肥打底，磷、钾肥适量添补，控氮肥防徒长，植株健壮抗螨；整枝打杈及时，通风透光良好，不给茶黄螨 “藏身之所”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>高温闷棚：温室大棚种植前，选晴天正午密闭棚室，</span><span class="text-color-green">升温至 50 - 60℃并维持 2 - 3 小时</span><span>，“一锅端” 螨虫全家。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>地膜覆盖：铺地膜阻螨于土壤外，稳温保湿促辣椒生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>以螨治螨：投放</span><span class="text-color-green">智利小植绥螨</span><span>，每平方米 10 - 20 头，趁螨害初起 “出击”，精准捕食。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物药剂：</span><span class="text-color-green">印楝素</span><span>按说明稀释喷雾，凭其活性成分干扰螨生理活动，抑制为害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂精选：1.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液（干扰神经传导）、73% </span><span class="text-color-green">克螨特</span><span>乳油 2000 - 3000 倍液（触杀与胃毒兼具）、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">哒螨灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液（抑制线粒体呼吸）为常用 “利器”。</span><span class="text-color-green">爱卡螨</span><span>（</span><span class="text-color-green">联苯肼酯）</span><span>。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>喷雾要点：瞄准嫩叶、嫩茎、花与幼果着重喷，喷雾均匀、无死角，确保药剂覆盖。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>注意事项：鉴于其繁殖快、易抗药，防治中轮换用药，严守剂量与安全间隔期规定。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蓟马：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生活习性：蓟马体型微小却极为活跃，喜隐匿于辣椒叶片背面、花器内、幼果萼片下等隐蔽处，且具趋蓝、趋嫩习性，晴天多在上午 9 点前与下午 4 点后频繁活动，阴天、傍晚全天活跃，稍受惊扰便迅速逃窜藏匿。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律：成虫或若虫在叶片、花、果实吸食，以成虫在杂草、土缝越冬，趋蓝性，温暖干燥繁殖快，受害叶片有白斑，花和果实品质受影响。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>繁殖特性：繁殖力惊人，在适宜温度（25 - 30℃）、湿度（相对湿度 40% - 70%）条件下，从卵至成虫仅需 14 - 18 天，雌虫可行孤雌生殖，产卵量多，卵多产于植株幼嫩组织表皮下、叶脉间等细微处。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：悬挂蓝色粘虫板，释放小花蝽等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<l');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0082', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '81', 'i class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>田园清理：辣椒收获后，即刻清除田间残株、杂草、落叶，集中深埋或烧毁，破坏蓟马越冬、越夏栖息与繁殖场所，减少虫源基数。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理轮作：避免连作，与十字花科、豆科等非茄科作物轮作，打乱蓟马生活周期，抑制种群繁衍。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>科学管理：增施有机肥、磷钾肥，控氮肥防植株徒长，促使辣椒植株生长健壮、组织坚实，增强抗虫能力；合理密植，保证通风透光良好，降低田间湿度，营造不适宜蓟马生存环境。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蓝色粘板诱捕：利用蓟马趋蓝特性，田间每亩悬挂 30 - 40 块</span><span class="text-color-green">蓝色粘虫板</span><span>，板高于辣椒植株顶部或持平，定期清理、更换粘板，确保诱捕效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防虫网隔离：育苗及定植期，在辣椒田覆盖 </span><span class="text-color-green">40 - 60 目防虫网</span><span>，阻挡蓟马侵入，在设施栽培中防护效果尤佳。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>天敌制衡</span><span class="text-color-green">：释放捕食螨</span><span>（如</span><span class="text-color-green">胡瓜钝绥螨</span><span>，每平方米 10 - 20 头）、小花蝽（每亩 500 - 1000 头）等天敌昆虫，于蓟马发生初期投放，借天敌捕食控制蓟马数量。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物药剂：选用球孢</span><span class="text-color-green">白僵菌、绿僵菌</span><span>等微生物制剂，按产品说明稀释喷雾，借助真菌寄生蓟马，致其染病死亡，绿色环保且防效持久。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂选择：可选用 2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">多杀霉素</span><span>悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液（作用于蓟马神经系统，麻痹致死）、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">溴虫氟苯双酰胺</span><span>悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液（干扰蓟马肌肉收缩功能）、6% </span><span class="text-color-green">乙基多杀菌</span><span>素悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液（刺激蓟马神经细胞致麻痹）、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1500 - 2000 倍液等喷雾，重点喷花和幼果等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>施药要点：选在蓟马活动高峰期（</span><span class="text-color-green">清晨或傍晚</span><span>）施药，</span><span class="text-color-green">加助剂</span><span>，重点喷施花朵、幼果、新梢等蓟马聚集部位，确保药剂覆盖均匀、细致，喷雾压力适中，以免蓟马受惊逃脱。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮换用药：为防蓟马产生抗药性，不同作用机制药剂交替使用，且严格遵循药剂安全间隔期，保障辣椒质量安全与防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">辣椒番茄病毒</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒病（黄瓜花叶病毒、烟草花叶病毒等多种）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原类型</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>黄瓜花叶病毒（CMV）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒粒体呈球状，寄主范围广泛，能侵染包括辣椒在内的众多蔬菜、花卉等植物。该病毒主要依赖蚜虫以非持久性方式传播，蚜虫在染病植株上短时间取食后，即可携带病毒并迅速传播至健康植株，病毒在寄主体内增殖迅速，可致使辣椒出现</span><span class="text-color-yellow">花叶、畸形等症状，新叶常黄绿斑驳、皱缩卷曲</span><span>，植株生长受抑，果实发育不良、变小且品质变差。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：多在植株顶部新叶发病，叶片出现深绿和浅绿相间的斑驳，叶片变小、变窄，呈蕨叶状，边缘卷曲。植株矮化，分枝增多，开花结果减少，果实小且僵硬，表面有瘤状突起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>识别要点：</span><span class="bold">蕨叶状叶片是显著特征</span><span>，新叶症状尤为明显。病毒可通过蚜虫等刺吸式口器害虫传播，田间有蚜虫活动且植株出现上述症状时，应重点考虑黄瓜花叶病毒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
