<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄黄化曲叶病毒（TYLCV）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：植株生长受阻，矮化明显。顶部叶片黄化、变小，叶片边缘上卷，严重时全株叶片黄化卷曲。下部老叶逐渐枯黄脱落，开花结果期延迟，坐果率低，果实发育不良，多为小果、僵果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
