  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>辣椒斑驳病毒（PepMoV）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>归属于马铃薯 Y 病毒属，同样仰仗蚜虫 “助力” 传播，在辣椒产区广泛分布。主要引发辣椒花叶与</span><span class="text-color-yellow">果实斑驳症状，叶片黄绿相间，果实外观斑驳杂乱</span><span>，植株生长速率放缓，产量与品质皆受波及。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
