<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温度：20 - 30℃堪称病毒 “活跃温区”，此温度下病毒复制、侵染效率高，传毒昆虫活跃度、活动范围也随之增大，利于病害流行。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>湿度：</span><span class="text-color-yellow">高湿环境</span><span>好似 “催化剂”，刺激蚜虫、粉虱大量滋生繁殖，它们在田间频繁穿梭、肆意传毒，大大增加辣椒染病几率。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培管理：连作会使土壤里病毒逐年 “囤积”，种植密度过大造成田间郁闭，通风透光受阻、湿度 “爆表”，再加上田间管理粗放，像施肥失衡（氮肥过量、磷钾不足）、排水不畅积水、病残体清理拖沓等，致使植株抗性滑坡，极易被病毒 “乘虚而入”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>首要传播 “帮凶” 是</span><span class="text-color-yellow">蚜虫、粉虱、蓟马等刺吸式口器昆虫</span><span>，它们在病株吸食带毒汁液后，转移至健康株继续取食，病毒借此跨株传播。虽说种子带毒比例不高，但仍存隐患，不可小觑种子这一潜在初侵染源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防措施</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>消毒：一是用 10% 磷酸三钠溶液浸种 20 - 30 分钟，磷酸三钠可促使病毒蛋白外壳变性失活，随后以清水洗净残留药剂；二是播前晒种 1 天，再用 55°C 温水浸种 20 分钟，凭借高温物理作用 “涤荡” 种子表面病毒，力保种子 “健康无虞”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拌种：按种子重量 0.3% 取用 50% 多菌灵可湿性粉剂拌种，在防控病毒之余，对其他病菌也有一定抵御功效，减轻种苗期病害压力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗病品种：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>优先择取如长剑、迅驰、37 - 76、辽椒 18、辽椒 19、红英达、红罗丹、奥黛丽等经实践验证、对病毒病抗性卓越的辣椒品种，从种植根基处强化防病 “壁垒”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培管理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>密度调控：依照辣椒品种特性，科学规划种植密度，保障田间通风透光优良，植株拥有适宜生长空间，抑制湿度攀升、病菌滋生。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>排水优化：完善田间排水体系，逢雨及时排水，杜绝积水引发根系缺氧、植株抗性衰败，不给病毒 “可乘之机”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理轮作：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>坚决规避连作，与非茄科作物开展 3 年及以上轮作、间作，以此打破病毒在土壤里的 “盘踞” 格局，削减病毒源头与传播链路，降低发病风险。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>施肥平衡：以有机肥作为基肥 “主力军”，适度增施磷钾肥，筑牢植株 “抗病根基”、提升整体抗性，严控氮肥用量防止徒长，护航植株稳健生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病残体清理：辣椒生长全程，见病株即刻拔除，带出田外妥善深埋；生产季收官之际，全面清田，销毁病残体，断了病毒 “越冬潜藏” 后路。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0084', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '83', 'list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治传毒昆虫：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>张挂 60 目</span><span class="text-color-green">防虫网</span><span>，物理隔绝蚜虫、粉虱 “进犯”；合理布</span><span class="text-color-green">设黄篮板、蓝板</span><span>，监测兼诱捕虫体；虫害汹涌时，选用化学药剂 “剿灭”，如 10% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液（吡虫啉干扰昆虫神经系统致麻痹死亡）、3% </span><span class="text-color-green">啶虫脒</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液（啶虫脒作用于昆虫乙酰胆碱受体令其麻痹）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>注意要点：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>交替用药：为规避抗药性 “滋生”，定期轮换不同作用机制药剂，稳固药效、保障防治长效性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>严守间隔期：严格依药剂说明书把控施药间隔、收获前停药时长，确保农药残留合规、辣椒产品质量安全。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂选择与使用：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒钝化剂：</span><span class="text-color-green">烷醇・硫酸铜、琥铜・吗啉胍</span><span>等，凭借所含成分特殊理化性质，干扰病毒在植株细胞内增殖环节，筑起阻止病毒扩散 “防线”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒抑制剂：</span><span class="text-color-green">吗呱・乙酸酮、宁南霉素、氯溴异氰尿酸、辛菌胺醋酸盐</span><span>等，从抑制病毒复制酶活性、阻断复制流程等多维度发力，“降速” 病毒繁衍，激活植株自身 “防御系统”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物增抗剂：</span><span class="text-color-green">香菇多糖、氨基寡糖素、低聚糖素</span><span>等，恰似 “免疫激发剂”，唤醒植株内在防御潜能，强化抵御病毒 “侵袭” 效能。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>具体药剂及配比：可选 6% </span><span class="text-color-green">寡糖・链蛋白</span><span>可湿性粉剂、1.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">植病灵</span><span>水乳剂（含三十烷醇助生长、硫酸铜抑病毒）、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">丁香酚</span><span>水乳剂、2% 几丁聚糖水剂、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">病毒 A</span><span> 可湿性粉剂（主要成分盐酸吗啉胍）等，按 7 - 10 天间隔，喷雾 2 - 3 次；也可采用 5% </span><span class="text-color-green">菌毒清水剂</span><span> 300 倍 + 1.5% 植病灵水剂 1000 倍液 + </span><span class="text-color-green">硫酸锌</span><span> 1000 倍喷施，或用 8% </span><span class="text-color-green">宁南霉素</span><span>水剂 1200 倍液、30% </span><span class="text-color-green">毒氟磷</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1200 倍液精准防控。对根部发病严重植株，适配药剂灌根 “补救”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拮抗菌利用：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>引入</span><span class="text-color-green">枯草芽孢杆菌、木霉菌</span><span>等有益微生物制剂，它们在植株表面或根际 “安营扎寨”，分泌抗菌、抗病毒物质，“制衡” 病毒肆虐，优化植株微生态，拔高抗病 “段位”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物提取物应用：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>启用</span><span class="text-color-green">大蒜素、苦参碱</span><span>等植物提取物喷雾，这类天然物质借独特化学结构 “干扰” 病毒生理进程、抑制活性，兼具环保、低毒 “绿色” 优势。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温汤浸种：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>启用 50℃温水浸种 15 分钟，借助热水 “消杀” 种子携带病毒，是简便高效净化种子 “妙招”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>覆盖地膜：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>铺透明地膜提温，优化土壤温湿度环境，抑制部分病原菌滋生繁衍，间接削减病毒病诱发 “因子”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>趋避害虫手段：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="text-color-green">安置杀虫灯 “光诱”、性诱剂 “色诱”、黄篮板及蓝板 “粘捕” 蚜虫与白粉虱，</span><span>截断病毒传播 “中介”，防范病害扩散。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>综合防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>监测预警：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定期 </span><span class="text-color-green">“巡田查岗</span><span>”，敏锐捕捉病害 “蛛丝马迹”，依发病态势及时优化调整防治策略，实现精准高效防控。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>综合管理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="text-color-green">融合农业、化学、生物、物理防治手段</span><span>，依据田间实时状况灵活调配施策，编织全方位、立体式防病 “安全网”。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
