  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片症状</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>发病初期，叶片边缘或尖端出现不规则的暗绿色水渍状病斑，病斑迅速扩大，颜色逐渐变为褐色。湿度大时，病斑背面边缘会产生一圈白色霉层，这是病原菌的孢囊梗和孢子囊。随着病情发展，病叶会逐渐枯萎、腐烂，最终脱落。</span></div>
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部症状</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>茎部受害时，最初出现暗绿色或褐色的水渍状斑点，随后病斑会环绕茎部扩展。病斑稍凹陷，质地变软，严重时会导致茎部缢缩、折断，影响植株的水分和养分运输，使植株上部枯萎。</span></div>
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实症状</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>果实染病多从青果近果柄处开始，初期为油渍状暗绿色病斑，后变为暗褐色至棕褐色，病斑稍凹陷，边缘不明显。在湿度高的环境下，病果表面也会产生白色霉层。病果后期会逐渐腐烂，失去商品价值。</span></div>
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>致病疫霉（Phytophthorainfestans），属于茸鞭生物界卵菌门疫霉属</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>病原菌主要以菌丝体在病残体或马铃薯块茎上越冬，在 18 - 22℃、相对湿度 95% 以上，菌丝体产生孢子囊，借风雨传播，从气孔或表皮侵入，地势低洼、种植过密、通风透光差地块发病重。致病疫霉主要以菌丝体在病残体或马铃薯块茎中越冬。在适宜的环境条件下，菌丝体产生孢子囊，孢子囊通过气流、雨水或灌溉水传播到番茄植株上，萌发产生游动孢子，游动孢子从气孔、伤口或表皮直接侵入植株，引发病害。</span></div>
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>低温高湿（18-22℃、相对湿度&gt;90%）易爆发，通过风雨、灌溉水传播，连作田发病重</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗病品种是防治番茄晚疫病最经济有效的方法。如‘中蔬 4 号’、‘佳粉 15 号’、‘强丰’等品种对晚疫病有一定的抗性。在种植前，可根据当地的气候条件和病害发生情况选择合适的抗病品种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作倒茬</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行与非茄科作物轮作，轮作周期一般为 3 - 4 年。避免连作，可减少病原菌在土壤中的积累，降低发病风险。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培管理</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理密植：根据品种特性和土壤肥力，合理确定种植密度，保证植株间通风透光良好。一般早熟品种每亩种植 3000 - 3500 株，中晚熟品种每亩种植 2500 - 3000 株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>整枝打杈：及时进行整枝打杈，去除病叶、病枝和老叶，改善植株通风透光条件，降低田间湿度，减少病原菌滋生的机会。同时，整枝打杈后的病残体要带出田外集中销毁，防止病原菌传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理施肥：施足基肥，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，提高植株的抗病能力。避免偏施氮肥，防止植株徒长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>排水降湿：高垄栽培，保持田间排水良好，避免田间积水。在雨季来临前，要清理沟渠，确保雨水能够及时排出。在设施栽培中，要注意通风换气，降低空气湿度。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在病害常发区或发病初期，可选用保护性杀菌剂进行预防。如 75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（主要成分百菌清，能抑制病原菌的孢子萌发和菌丝生长）、80% </span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（代森锰锌主要成分是乙撑双二硫代氨基甲酸锰和锌盐，通过与病原菌的含硫基团反应，抑制其酶活性）。每隔 7 - 10 天喷一次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>当发现病斑后，要及时选用治疗性杀菌剂进行防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期喷施霜霉威盐酸盐、嘧菌酯等药剂，7-10天1次，连喷2-3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>68.75% </span><span class="text-color-green">氟菌・霜霉威</span><span>悬浮剂 600 - 800 倍液：主要成分是氟吡菌胺和霜霉威，氟吡菌胺能抑制病原菌的细胞壁合成，霜霉威则干扰病原菌的细胞膜功能，两者协同作用，对晚疫病有良好的防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="con');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0088', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '87', 'tent mm-editor" ><span>52.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">恶唑菌酮・霜脲氰水</span><span>分散粒剂 1500 - 2000 倍液：恶唑菌酮主要通过抑制病原菌的线粒体呼吸作用来发挥杀菌功能，霜脲氰能阻止病原菌的孢子萌发和菌丝生长，这种复配药剂杀菌谱广、效果好。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>72% </span><span class="text-color-green">霜脲・锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液：含有</span><span class="text-color-green">霜脲氰</span><span>和代森锰锌，霜脲氰具有内吸性，能快速进入植物体内发挥杀菌作用，代森锰锌则在植物表面形成保护膜，防止病原菌侵入，两者配合可有效控制病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>64% </span><span class="text-color-green">噁霜・锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 400 - 500 倍液：噁霜灵主要成分能抑制病原菌的 RNA 合成，代森锰锌起保护作用，对晚疫病有较好的治疗和保护双重作用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拮抗微生物利用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>利用</span><span class="text-color-green">芽孢杆菌</span><span>（Bacillus spp.），哈茨木霉菌等有益微生物来防治番茄晚疫病。芽孢杆菌可以在植株表面定殖，与病原菌竞争营养和空间，并且能够分泌抗菌物质抑制病原菌的生长。例如，将枯草芽孢杆菌制剂按照产品说明稀释后进行喷雾或灌根，可以在一定程度上减轻病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
