<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>真菌性病害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄早疫病（Alternaria solani）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">症状</span><span>：叶片病斑圆形，褐色至黑褐色，具同心轮纹，边缘黄褐色；茎部病斑椭圆形，凹陷；果实病斑多在蒂部，圆形黑褐色，轮纹明显</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期，叶片上出现针尖大小的黑褐色圆形斑点，随后病斑逐渐扩大，直径可达 1 - 2 厘米。病斑边缘呈深褐色，中间为灰褐色，有同心轮纹，这是早疫病的典型特征。湿度大时，病斑上会生出黑色霉状物，这是病原菌的分生孢子梗和分生孢子。随着病情发展，病斑会相互连接，导致叶片枯黄、脱落。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部受害时，病斑多发生在分枝处或茎节附近。最初为暗褐色的椭圆形或梭形病斑，稍凹陷。病斑扩大后，会环绕茎部，使茎部缢缩，导致上部植株枯萎。病斑上也会出现黑色霉层。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实发病多从果蒂附近开始，初期为黑色圆形病斑，随后病斑扩大，可达果面的 1/3 - 1/2。病斑凹陷，质地变硬，有同心轮纹，上面同样会生出黑色霉状物。病果易脱落，严重影响果实的商品价值。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">图片</span></div>
    
    
