<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">病原</span><span>：番茄早疫病又称轮纹病，是一种由</span><span class="text-color-yellow">链格孢属</span><span>（Alternaria solani）真菌引起的常见番茄病害</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发病规律</span><span>：病原菌以菌丝体或分生孢子在病残体或种子上越冬，在 20 - 25℃、湿度适宜时，分生孢子借气流、雨水传播，从气孔、皮孔或表皮侵入，植株生长衰弱、连作、偏施氮肥发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌来源与传播</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在适宜的环境条件下，分生孢子通过气流、雨水飞溅等方式传播到番茄植株上，从气孔、伤口或直接穿透表皮侵入。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温度和湿度：早疫病适宜在温暖湿润的环境中发生。病原菌生长的适宜温度为 26 - 28℃，分生孢子萌发需要较高的湿度，相对湿度在 80% 以上有利于病害的发生。在连续阴雨天气、通风不良、植株茂密的情况下，病害容易流行。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植株生长状况：种植密度过大、植株生长衰弱、缺肥等情况会增加植株的感病性。另外，番茄生长中后期，随着果实的生长发育，植株营养消耗较大，此时如果管理不当，也容易感染早疫病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">防治方法</span><span>：发病初期，可选用 70% </span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 - 600 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂 800 - 1000 倍液、戊唑醇等防治每 7 - 10 天喷 1 次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗病品种是防治番茄早疫病的有效措施。如 “佳粉 17 号”、“中蔬 4 号” 等品种对早疫病有一定的抗性。在种植前，可根据当地的病害发生情况和种植经验选择合适的品种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子可能携带病原菌，因此要进行种子处理。可以用 52℃温水浸种 30 分钟，或者用 0.3% - 0.5% 的硫酸铜溶液浸种 5 - 10 分钟，浸种后用清水冲洗干净，晾干后播种。这些方法可以杀死种子表面的病原菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作倒茬</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行与非茄科作物轮作，轮作周期 3 - 4 年。例如与豆科、十字花科等作物轮作，可减少土壤中病原菌的积累，降低发病风险。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培管理</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理密植：根据品种特性和土壤肥力合理确定种植密度。一般早熟品种每亩种植 3000 - 3500 株，中晚熟品种每亩种植 2500 - 3000 株，保证植株间通风透光良好。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>整枝打杈：及时进行整枝打杈，去除病叶、病枝和老叶，改善植株通风透光条件，减少病原菌滋生的机会。整枝打杈后的病残体要带出田外集中销毁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理施肥：施足基肥，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，提高植株的抗病能力。避免偏施氮肥，防止植株徒长。例如，基肥可以每亩施用腐熟农家肥 3000 - 5000 千克、过磷酸钙 50 - 100 千克、硫酸钾 15 - 20 千克。在番茄生长过程中，根据植株生长阶段适时追肥。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土壤改良：保持土壤疏松、透气，排水良好。对于酸性土壤，可以适量施用石灰调节土壤酸碱度，抑制病原菌的生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在病害常发区或发病初期，可选用保护性杀菌剂进行预防。如 75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（百菌清主要成分能抑制病原菌的孢子萌发和菌丝生长）、80% </span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（代森锰锌主要成分通过与病原菌反应，抑制其酶活性）。每隔 7 - 10 天喷一次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>当发现病斑后，要及时选用治疗性杀菌剂进行防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>10% </span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：苯醚甲环唑主要成分能抑制病原菌的细胞色素 P450 酶活性，从而阻止病原菌的麦角甾醇合成，达到杀菌效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：异菌脲主要成分是一种广谱杀菌剂，它可以抑制病原菌的蛋白质合成，对早疫病有良好的防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>70% </span><span cl');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0091', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '90', 'ass="text-color-green">甲基硫菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 800 - 1000 倍液：甲基硫菌灵主要成分能干扰病原菌的细胞分裂，抑制菌丝生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>43% </span><span class="text-color-green">戊唑醇悬</span><span>浮剂 2000 - 3000 倍液：戊唑醇主要成分是一种三唑类杀菌剂，能抑制病原菌的麦角甾醇合成，影响细胞膜的完整性，从而达到杀菌的目的。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拮抗微生物利用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>利用</span><span class="text-color-yellow">木霉菌</span><span>（Trichoderma spp.）来防治番茄早疫病。木霉菌可以在土壤和植株表面定殖，与病原菌竞争营养和空间，并且能够分泌几丁质酶等抗菌物质分解病原菌的细胞壁。按照产品说明将木霉菌制剂施用于土壤或植株表面，可以减轻病害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物源杀菌剂应用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>有些植物源药剂如印楝素，从印楝树中提取。将</span><span class="text-color-green">印楝素</span><span>制剂按照推荐浓度稀释后进行喷雾，它可以干扰病原菌的生理功能，对番茄早疫病有一定的防治作用，并且对环境友好，不易使病原菌产生抗药性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄灰霉病（Botrytis cinerea）：同辣椒灰霉病规律、防治方法类似。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>花器受害症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病害通常先从残留的花瓣、柱头或花托侵染，发病初期，这些部位出现水渍状淡褐色病斑。随着病情发展，病斑逐渐扩大，变为褐色，表面长出一层鼠灰色霉层，这是病原菌的分生孢子梗和分生孢子。花朵受害后，花瓣腐烂、枯萎，进而向果实和茎部蔓延。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实受害症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>幼果染病多从果蒂开始，最初为水渍状、淡褐色小斑点，随后病斑迅速扩展，可环绕果蒂一周。果实稍大时发病，病斑多在果脐、果柄或果面出现，病斑圆形或椭圆形，颜色加深为褐色至暗褐色，病部组织软腐，果皮易破裂。湿度大时，病果表面长满灰色霉层，病果最后脱落或失水僵化。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片受害症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片发病多从叶尖或叶缘开始，初期为水渍状、浅褐色病斑，病斑呈 “V” 字形向内扩展，这是因为叶尖和叶缘的水分和养分比较充足，有利于病原菌的生长。后期病斑颜色变深，呈褐色至暗褐色，边缘有深浅相间的轮纹。湿度高时，病斑表面产生灰色霉层。严重时，多个病斑相连，导致叶片干枯、坏死。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部受害症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部染病初期，出现水渍状小斑点，随后病斑扩展成长椭圆形或长条形，颜色为淡褐色至褐色。病斑可环绕茎部，使茎部缢缩，上部叶片因水分和养分运输受阻而枯萎。在病斑表面也会产生灰色霉层，严重时茎部腐烂、折断。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄灰霉病是由</span><span class="text-color-yellow">灰葡萄孢菌（Botrytis cinerea）</span><span>引起的一种真菌性病害。这种病害在全球番茄种植区广泛分布，是保护地番茄生产中的主要病害之一，对番茄的产量和品质造成严重的损害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
