  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌核在土壤或病残体越冬，20 - 23℃、相对湿度 90% 以上发病，花期侵染风险高。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌存活与传播</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌主要以菌核在土壤中或病残体上越冬，也可以菌丝体及分生孢子在病残体和其他有机物上存活。在适宜的环境条件下，菌核萌发产生菌丝体和分生孢子，分生孢子通过气流、雨水、灌溉水、农事操作（如整枝、打杈、采摘等）等方式传播到番茄植株上，成为初侵染源。病原菌可以从植株的伤口（如机械损伤、虫咬伤口等）、自然孔口（如气孔、皮孔等）或衰弱的组织部位侵入。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温度和湿度：灰霉病是一种典型的低温高湿型病害。病原菌生长和孢子萌发的适宜温度为 18 - 23℃，相对湿度在 90% 以上。在这种环境下，病原菌繁殖迅速，病害容易发生和流行。因此，在冬春季节的温室大棚内，由于温度较低、湿度较大，以及通风不良等因素，灰霉病容易大面积爆发。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植株生长状况：种植密度过大、植株生长茂密、通风透光差、植株生长衰弱（如营养不良、受冻害等）等情况都有利于病害的发生。此外，番茄开花期和幼果期是灰霉病的侵染高峰期，因为这两个时期花器和幼果的组织比较幼嫩，抵抗力较弱。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：花期选 40% 嘧霉胺悬浮剂等喷雾，重点喷花和幼果。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗病品种是防治灰霉病的重要措施之一。一些抗灰霉病的番茄品种在种植过程中发病相对较轻，例如 “仙客 1 号”、“佳粉 15 号” 等。在种植前，可以根据当地的种植环境和病害发生情况，选择合适的抗病品种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作倒茬</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行与非茄科作物轮作，轮作周期 3 - 4 年。通过轮作可以减少土壤中病原菌的积累，降低发病风险。例如与禾本科、豆科等作物轮作，打破病原菌的生存环境。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培管理</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理密植：根据番茄品种和土壤肥力合理确定种植密度，一般每亩种植 2000 - 3000 株。保证植株间通风透光良好，降低田间湿度，减少病原菌滋生的机会。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>整枝打杈：及时进行整枝打杈，去除病叶、病枝、残花和病果，带出田外集中销毁。整枝打杈操作应在晴天进行，避免在阴雨天操作，防止病原菌传播。同时，在整枝打杈后，可以用 70% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲基硫菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 - 800 倍液或 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 400 - 600 倍液涂抹伤口，预防病原菌侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>调节温湿度：在设施栽培中，要注意控制温湿度。白天温度保持在 25 - 28℃，夜间温度控制在 15 - 18℃，相对湿度控制在 70% - 80%。通过合理通风、覆盖地膜、控制浇水等措施来调节温湿度。例如，在晴天中午适当通风，降低空气湿度；采用滴灌或膜下暗灌的方式浇水，避免大水漫灌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>合理施肥：施足基肥，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，提高植株的抗病能力。避免偏施氮肥，防止植株徒长。例如，基肥可以每亩施用腐熟农家肥 3000 - 5000 千克、过磷酸钙 50 - 100 千克、硫酸钾 15 - 20 千克。在番茄生长过程中，根据植株生长阶段适时追肥，保证植株营养均衡。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在病害常发区或发病初期，可选用保护性杀菌剂进行预防。如 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">福美双</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（福美双主要成分能抑制病原菌的酶活性，阻止其生长）、75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（百菌清主要成分可抑制病原菌的孢子萌发和菌丝生长）。每隔 7 - 10 天喷一次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0092', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '91', ' class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>当发现病斑后，要及时选用治疗性杀菌剂进行防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>40% </span><span class="text-color-green">嘧霉胺</span><span>悬浮剂 800 - 1000 倍液：嘧霉胺主要成分是一种新型杀菌剂，它能抑制病原菌的蛋白质合成，对灰霉病有很好的防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：异菌脲主要成分是一种广谱杀菌剂，通过抑制病原菌的细胞分裂和蛋白质合成来发挥作用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：腐霉利主要成分能够干扰病原菌的细胞膜和细胞壁的合成，抑制其生长和繁殖。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.5</span><span class="text-color-green">% 咯菌腈</span><span>悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：咯菌腈主要成分可以抑制病原菌的线粒体呼吸作用，从而达到杀菌的目的。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>拮抗微生物利用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>利用</span><span class="text-color-green">木霉菌</span><span>（Trichoderma spp.）防治番茄灰霉病。木霉菌可以在土壤和植株表面定殖，与病原菌竞争营养和空间，并且能够分泌几丁质酶等抗菌物质分解病原菌的细胞壁。例如，哈茨木霉菌制剂按照产品说明进行土壤处理或喷雾，可以有效抑制灰霉病的发生。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物源杀菌剂应用</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>应用植物源杀菌剂，如</span><span class="text-color-green">大蒜素</span><span>。大蒜素是从大蒜中提取的天然抗菌物质，将其制剂按照推荐浓度稀释后进行喷雾，它可以破坏病原菌的细胞膜，干扰其生理功能，对灰霉病有一定的防治作用，并且对环境友好，不易使病原菌产生抗药性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>如何有效防治番茄灰霉病？</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>在病害常发区或发病初期，用保护性杀菌剂预防。如 50% 福美双可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（福美双主要成分抑制病原菌的酶活性）、75% 百菌清可湿性粉剂 600 - 800 倍液（百菌清主要成分抑制孢子萌发和菌丝生长）。每隔 7 - 10 天喷一次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发现病斑后，及时用治疗性杀菌剂防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>40</span><span class="text-color-green">% 嘧霉胺</span><span>悬浮剂 800 - 1000 倍液：嘧霉胺主要成分抑制病原菌蛋白质合成，对灰霉病防治效果好。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：异菌脲主要成分是广谱杀菌剂，抑制细胞分裂和蛋白质合成。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：腐霉利主要成分干扰病原菌细胞膜和细胞壁合成。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">咯菌腈</span><span>悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液：咯菌腈主要成分抑制病原菌线粒体呼吸作用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄灰霉病和晚疫病的症状有哪些区别？</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）叶片症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片发病多从叶尖或叶缘开始，初期为水渍状、浅褐色病斑，呈 “V” 字形向内扩展。后期病斑颜色变深，呈褐色至暗褐色，边缘有深浅相间的轮纹。湿度高时，病斑表面产生灰色霉层。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>晚疫病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期，叶片边缘或尖端出现不规则的暗绿色水渍状病斑，病斑迅速扩大，颜色逐渐变为褐色。湿度大时，病斑背面边缘会产生一圈白色霉层，这是病原菌的孢囊梗和孢子囊。病情发展后，病叶会逐渐枯萎、腐烂，最终脱落。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）果实症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>幼果染病多从果蒂开始，最初为水渍状、淡褐色小斑点，随后病斑迅速扩展，可环绕果蒂一周。果实稍大时发病，病斑多在果脐、果柄或果面出现，病斑圆形或椭圆形，颜色加深为褐色至暗褐色，病部组织软腐，果皮易破裂。湿度大时，病果表面长满灰色霉层，病果最后脱落或失水僵化。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>晚疫病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>果实染病多从青果近果柄处开始，初期为油渍状暗绿色病斑，后变为暗褐色至棕褐色，病斑稍凹陷，边缘不明显。在湿度高的环境下，病果表面也会产生白色霉层。病果后期会逐渐腐烂，失去商品价值。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）茎部症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部染病初期，出现水渍状小斑点，随后病斑扩展成长椭圆形或长条形，颜色为淡褐色至褐色。病斑可环绕茎部，使茎部缢缩，上部叶片因水分和养分运输受阻而枯萎。在病斑表面也会产生灰色霉层，严重时茎部腐烂、折断。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>晚疫病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎部受害时，最初出现暗绿色或褐色的水渍状斑点，随后病斑会环绕茎部扩展。病斑稍凹陷，质地变软，严重时会导致茎部缢缩、折断，影响植株的水分和养分运输，使植株上部枯萎。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄早疫病的传播途径是什么？</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌来源</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌主要以菌丝体和分生孢子在病残体或种子上越冬。种子带菌是病害远距离传播的一个重要途径，在种子发芽和幼苗生长过程中，病原菌会侵染植株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播方式</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
