  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>治疗用药</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>当发现病斑后，要及时选用治疗性杀菌剂进行防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>25% </span><span class="text-color-green">咪鲜胺</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液：咪鲜胺主要成分是一种广谱杀菌剂，它可以抑制病原菌的</span><span class="text-color-green">麦角甾醇</span><span>合成，对番茄炭疽病有良好的防治效果。</span></div>
    
    
    
