    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 - 800 倍液：多菌灵主要成分能干扰病原菌的细胞分裂，抑制菌丝生长。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
