    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>核盘菌（Sclerotiniasclerotiorum），属于子囊菌门核盘菌属。</span></div>
    
    
    
