<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：菌核越冬，15 - 20℃、湿度大时萌发侵染。通过气流、灌溉水传播，棚室通风差、连作田病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：深翻土壤，轮作，清理病残体，棚室通风降湿。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期用菌核净、腐霉利喷雾或灌根。</span><span class="node-mention" id="me8bjbaKOA" spellcheck="false" contenteditable="false" data-doc="z_AdxEsGm0" data-node="RO67pCERkV" data-text="%5B%7B%22type%22%3A1%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%8F%8C%E6%A0%B8%E7%97%85%EF%BC%88Sclerotinia%20sclerotiorum%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9A%22%2C%22style%22%3A%7B%7D%7D%5D"><span>菌核病（Sclerotinia sclerotiorum）：</span></span><span></span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：轮作2-3年，深翻土壤，清除病残体，</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：发病初期喷施腐霉利、菌核净等药剂，重点喷洒茎基部和地面。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄斑枯病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
