<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根结线虫属（Meloidogynespp.），主要为南方根结线虫、爪哇根结线虫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土传病害，25-30℃、砂质土壤利于线虫繁殖，连作田发病重，通过土壤、灌溉水传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：与禾本科作物轮作4-5年，深翻土壤，增施有机肥，种植诱虫植物（如万寿菊）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：播种前土壤施线虫剂（如噻唑膦），发病初期用阿维菌素灌根。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄病毒</span></div>
    
    <div class="note mm-editor"><span>病毒种类繁多，传播、影响都比较大，但是大家不用区分太详细，防治和预防都是一样的，建议主要参考最后一个“斑萎病毒”</span></div>
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄烟草花叶病毒病（TMV）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>烟草花叶病毒（Tobaccomosaicvirus，TMV），属于烟草花叶病毒属，为单链 RNA 病毒。病毒粒体呈杆状，大小为 300nm×18nm，具有极强的稳定性，在干燥病组织中可存活多年，汁液中稀释至 100 万倍仍保持致病力。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
    <li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_d33dd5eb-636a-4ffd-b699-b4dbd8154a1a.png"
      style="width: 400px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（三）症状表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>花叶型：叶片出现黄绿相间或深绿、浅绿相间的斑驳花叶，叶面皱缩、变形，植株生长受抑，果实变小、品质下降。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蕨叶型：植株不同程度矮化，上部叶片细长呈线状，叶肉组织退化，叶片皱缩扭曲，形似蕨类植物叶片。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>条斑型：可发生于叶片、茎蔓和果实。叶片上出现褐色或黑褐色坏死条纹；茎蔓上形成黑褐色长条形凹陷坏死斑；果实表面出现圆形或不规则形褐色凹陷斑，凹凸不平、僵化，完全失去商品价值。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（四）发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>侵染源：主要在病残体、种子、土壤及多年生杂草上越冬，种子带毒是病毒远距离传播的重要途径。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：主要通过汁液接触、农事操作（如整枝、打杈）传播，蚜虫、粉虱可辅助传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件：高温干旱环境利于病毒增殖和传播；植株生长衰弱、田间管理粗放、连作、土壤带毒等情况会加重病情。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（五）预防和防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗（耐）病品种，如 “佳粉 15 号” 等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理：用 10% 磷酸三钠溶液浸种 20-30 分钟，清水冲洗干净后播种，可钝化种子表面病毒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行轮作：与非茄科作物轮作 2-3 年，减少土壤中病毒残留。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理：合理施肥，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，补充锌元素，提高植株抗病力；及时清除田间杂草、病株及病残体，减少侵染源；增加田间空气湿度、适当降温，创造不利于病毒增殖的环境。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>采用防虫网覆盖栽培，防止蚜虫、粉虱等传毒媒介进入田间。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治传毒媒介：蚜虫发生期，选用 10% 吡虫啉可湿性粉剂 1000-1500 倍液喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒病防治：发病初期，选用 20% 病毒 A 可湿性粉剂 500-700 倍液、1.5% 植病灵乳剂 1000 倍液、宁南霉素制剂、吗啉胍・乙酸铜制剂等喷雾，每隔 7-10 天喷 1 次，连喷 3-4 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>喷施香菇多糖、氨基寡糖素等生物制剂，诱导植株产生抗逆性，减轻病害症状。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄黄化曲叶病毒病（TYLCV）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（0）图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ></div>
    <ul class="image-list">
    <li class="image-item">
    <img
      src="https://api2.mubu.com/v3/document_image/3252562_a47585bd-d590-4aac-ff76-d119e006e248.jpeg"
      style="width: 300px;"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      class="image"
    />
  </li>
  </ul>
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（一）病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄黄化曲叶病毒（Tomato yellow leaf curl virus，TYLCV），属于双生病毒科菜豆金色花叶病毒属，为单链 DNA 病毒。病毒粒体呈双联体结构，大小约 18-20nm。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（二）症状表现</span></div>
    
    
