INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0102', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '101', '   <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：仅由烟粉虱（B 型、Q 型为主）持久性传播，不能通过种子、汁液摩擦等方式传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件：高温干旱环境（25-30℃）利于烟粉虱繁殖和活动，加速病毒传播；连作地块、棚室通风不良、田间杂草丛生时发病重；夏秋季为高发期，植株苗期至开花坐果期易感病；种植抗（耐）病性差的品种会加重病情。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（四）预防和防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗（耐）病品种，如 “迪芬尼”“硬粉 8 号”“中杂 105” 等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行轮作：与非茄科作物轮作 3-4 年，减少田间病毒残留和侵染源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理：合理施肥，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，培育健壮植株，增强抗病力；及时清除田间及棚室周围杂草，切断病毒越冬和传播链条。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>棚室栽培时，覆盖 40-60 目防虫网，彻底阻断烟粉虱进入田间。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>田间悬挂蓝色粘虫板（每亩 20-30 块），针对性诱捕烟粉虱成虫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定植前对棚室进行彻底消毒（如高温闷棚），杀灭残留烟粉虱及虫卵。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
