    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>释放丽蚜小蜂、桨角蚜小蜂等烟粉虱天敌，自然控制烟粉虱种群数量，减少病毒传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
