    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>二、症状表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 叶片症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>初期：顶部幼叶出现青铜色（铜色）光泽，叶面向上卷曲Clemson University</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>中期：叶片出现褐色或黄色环斑，呈同心轮纹状（靶标状），严重时叶片布满斑点呈 </span><span class="bold">"网纹状"</span><span>UF/IFAS Department of Plant Pathology</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>后期：叶片皱缩、扭曲，叶背沿叶脉呈紫色，部分叶片尖端坏死，整株矮化</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 茎秆症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎秆和叶柄上形成暗褐色条纹（坏死条斑），严重时导致茎部扭曲、生长受阻</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3. 果实症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>幼果表面产生浅色环斑，未成熟果实出现白色至黄色同心环纹，环中心突起使果面局部隆起</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>成熟果实出现橘黄色和红色环纹斑，部分果实呈肿瘤状畸形，品质严重下降，失去商品价值</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>4. 整株表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植株严重矮化，生长迟缓，开花结果延迟，坐果率降低，产量锐减</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>早期感染（苗期）常导致植株 </span><span class="bold">"shepherd''s crook"</span><span>（牧羊杖状）畸形，甚至死亡，不能结果</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>三、发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 侵染源</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要在病残体、杂草（如苦苣菜、野大丽花）和带毒种苗上越冬，成为次年主要初侵染源</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒寄主范围极广，可侵染85 科 1000 多种植物，包括番茄、辣椒、茄子、马铃薯、莴苣、西瓜等蔬菜，以及多种花卉和杂草</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 传播途径</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>唯一自然传播媒介：蓟马（Thrips），包括西花蓟马（Frankliniella occidentalis）、烟蓟马（Thrips tabaci）等至少 10 种蓟马</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传毒特性：持久性传毒，即蓟马只能在幼虫期（1 龄若虫）获取病毒，病毒在蓟马体内增殖后才能传毒，成虫可终身带毒（约 20 天）Tomato Spotted Wilt Virus</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蓟马获毒时间：烟蓟马最短15-30 分钟，豆蓟马约30 分钟，时间越长传毒效率越高</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>人为传播：通过汁液摩擦（农事操作如整枝、打杈）和带毒种苗调运进行远距离传播</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3. 发病条件</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>温度：28-32℃高温干旱环境最有利于病毒增殖和蓟马活动，加速传播</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>湿度：干旱条件下发病重，高湿环境抑制蓟马活动，减缓传播</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植株状态：苗期和生长前期最易感病，植株长势弱、田间管理粗放时发病加重</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>栽培因素：连作地块、杂草丛生、与茄科作物邻作时发病风险高</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>流行规律：露地栽培（4 月定植）番茄，5 月开始零星发病，7 月进入发病高峰，病株以点带面逐渐扩展</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>四、预防和防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div ');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0105', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '104', 'class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 农业防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用抗病品种：选择含Sw-5 基因的番茄品种（如 '' 抗 TY-1'' 系列），注意部分地区已出现抗性突破株系</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理：10% 磷酸三钠溶液浸种20-30 分钟，清水冲洗后播种，钝化种子表面病毒，55℃温水浸种15 分钟（温汤浸种），冷却后继续浸种 6-8 小时</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作倒茬：与非茄科作物（如十字花科、禾本科）轮作3-4 年，减少土壤中病毒积累</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>清除侵染源：定植前彻底清除田间及周边杂草（特别是苦苣菜、野大丽花等病毒寄主），及时拔除病株并销毁，减少田间病毒扩散</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>科学栽培：培育健壮植株，增强抗病力，避免干旱和高温环境，小水勤浇，</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农具人员消毒：农事操作前消毒工具和手，避免人为传播</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>避免与辣椒、茄子等 TSWV 寄主作物邻作或套种</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 物理防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防虫网隔离：在棚室通风口、入口安装40-60 目防虫网，阻止蓟马进入</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>色板诱杀：田间悬挂蓝色粘虫板（蓟马对蓝色有强趋性），每亩20-30 块（20cm×25cm），监测和诱杀成虫，也可配合使用黄色粘虫板，监测其他害虫</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>银灰地膜覆盖：利用银灰色对蓟马的驱避作用，减少蓟马着落，降低传毒风险</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>遮阳降温：高温季节覆盖遮阳网，降低田间温度，减轻发病</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3. 生物防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>释放天敌：在蓟马发生初期释放捕食性天敌如小花蝽（Orius spp.）、捕食螨或寄生蜂（如捕食螨）控制蓟马种群</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物农药：喷施球孢白僵菌或绿僵菌等微生物杀虫剂，对蓟马有良好防治效果</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>植物源农药如印楝素、除虫菊素等，对蓟马有一定驱避和毒杀作用，且对环境友好</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>4. 化学防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（1）防治蓟马（关键措施）</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定植前处理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>穴施噻虫嗪颗粒剂（如 25% 噻虫嗪水分散粒剂），持效期可达 30 天，预防早期蓟马传毒</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>移栽前1-2 天，对幼苗喷施吡虫啉（10% 可湿性粉剂 1000-1500 倍液）或噻虫嗪（25% 水分散粒剂 3000-5000 倍液），可降低 TSWV 发生率 50% 以上</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生长期防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.5% 多杀霉素悬浮剂1000-1500 倍液（菜喜），对蓟马特效且对天敌安全</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>10% 虫螨腈乳油2000 倍液或 5% 氟虫腈悬浮剂1500 倍液，具有触杀和胃毒作用</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>10% 吡虫啉可湿性粉剂1000-2000 倍液或 25% 噻虫嗪水分散粒剂3000 倍液，内吸性强，持效期长</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>5% 甲维盐・啶虫脒乳油1500 倍液，兼具胃毒和触杀作用，对蓟马效果好</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>注意：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>喷药时间宜在早晨或傍晚，此时蓟马活动较频繁，效果更好</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>重点喷洒叶背和茎基部（蓟马藏匿处），并注意轮换用药，避免抗药性产生</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>每7-10 天喷一次，连续2-3 次，可有效控制蓟马种群</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>（2）防治病毒病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期（病毒尚未系统侵染前）及时用药：2% 宁南霉素水剂200-300 倍液或 8% 宁南霉素・吗啉胍水剂500-800 倍液，抑制病毒复制</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>20% 盐酸吗啉胍・乙酮可湿性粉剂500 倍液或 32% 核苷・溴・吗啉胍水剂1000 倍液，干扰病毒核酸合成</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2% 氨基寡糖素水剂300-500 倍液或寡糖・链蛋白，诱导植物产生抗性，减轻症状</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>辛菌胺 + 盐酸吗啉胍 + 氨基寡糖素 + 喹啉铜（或烯・羟・吗啉胍）组合使用，可提高防治效果</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治策略总结：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>采用 "预防为主，综合防治"方针，重点是 </span><span class="bold">" 切断毒源、治虫防病 "</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>关键措施：种植抗病品种 + 彻底防治蓟马 + 清除杂草 + 物理隔离 + 发病前预防用药</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>单一防治措施效果有限，必须采取综合防控策略才能有效控制 TSWV 危害Tomato Spotted Wilt Virus</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading2">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>五、特别提示</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>早期识别：发现顶部叶片出现青铜色光泽和环斑症状，应立即检测确认，及时拔除病株并销毁</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>抗性管理：含 Sw-5 基因的抗性品种仍是目前最有效防治手段，但需注意抗性监测，发现抗性失效应及时更换品种</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>季节防控：高温干旱季节（6-8 月）是防控关键期，应加密监测和防治频次，特别注意蓟马防控</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂混用：病毒病防治药剂可与叶面肥（如磷酸二氢钾）和植物生长调节剂混用，增强植株抗逆性，减轻症状</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄虫害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄白粉虱</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：在温室可周年繁衍，露地借杂草等寄主越冬，成虫趋黄性、喜聚集在叶片背面吸食汁液、产卵，繁殖适温20 - 28℃，温暖干燥环境下种群数量剧增，春秋季为害猖獗，其分泌蜜露引发煤污病，影响光合作用。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：温室通风口设防虫网，田间悬挂黄色粘虫板诱杀，种植前清理田园周边杂草残株，释放丽蚜小蜂等天敌昆虫抑制种群。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：可选用25%</span><span class="text-color-green">噻虫嗪</span><span>水分散粒剂3000 - 5000倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">烯啶虫胺</span><span>水剂1000 - 1500倍液等喷雾，注意叶片正反两面均匀喷施，5 - 7天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄蚜虫</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：多以卵在木槿、花椒等越冬寄主上越冬，春天气温回升孵化，有翅蚜迁飞至番茄田，16 - 22℃、湿度适宜时繁殖迅猛，常群集于嫩梢、叶片背面、花蕾吸食，致叶片卷曲畸形、生长受阻，还传播多种病毒病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0106', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '105', '-editor" ><span>预防方法：田园周边避免种植越冬寄主，悬挂黄色粘虫板，保护和助迁瓢虫、草蛉等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用10%</span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">抗蚜威</span><span>可湿性粉剂2000 - 3000倍液等喷雾，重点喷有蚜部位，7 - 10天1次，视虫情喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄棉铃虫</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以蛹在土壤中蛰伏越冬，成虫具趋光性、趋化性，夜间活跃，产卵于番茄嫩叶、花蕾、果实处，幼虫孵化先啃食嫩叶，后蛀食果实，25 - 28℃、相对湿度70%左右繁殖和为害达高峰，7 - 9月为害集中。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：秋末冬初深耕翻土，破坏蛹室，利用黑光灯、糖醋液（糖:醋:酒:水 = 4:3:1:2）诱捕成虫，及时摘除虫果、清理残株减少虫源。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：幼虫3龄前，用2.5%</span><span class="text-color-green">溴氰菊酯</span><span>乳油2000 - 3000倍液、5%</span><span class="text-color-green">高效氯氟氰菊酯</span><span>乳油1500 - 2000倍液等喷雾，确保药剂覆盖果实、叶片等部位，7 - 10天1次，依虫情喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄甜菜夜蛾，斜纹夜蛾</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>昼伏夜出，1-2龄叶片背面取食叶肉，留下表皮，3龄吃花苞叶片孔洞或缺刻或钻蛀果穗，4龄以后大量取食叶肉吃光留下叶柄叶脉。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄烟青虫</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：与棉铃虫习性相似，以蛹在土中越冬，成虫昼伏夜出，产卵于番茄植株各部位，幼虫蛀食果实，偏爱甜椒、辣椒类，25 - 28℃、湿度适宜时繁殖活跃，夏季为害重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：及时清除杂草、残株，破坏栖息产卵环境，糖醋液诱捕成虫，人工摘除卵块。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：幼虫初孵期，用</span><span class="text-color-green">苏云金芽孢杆菌</span><span>（Bt）制剂按产品说明稀释、1.8%</span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油1000 - 1500倍液喷雾，重点保护果实，7 - 10天1次，喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄茶黄螨</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：雌成螨在避风隐蔽处如枯枝落叶、杂草根部越冬，16 - 23℃、湿度适宜时，迁移至番茄植株，聚集于嫩梢、叶片、花、果实吸食，受害部位呈油渍状、畸形，生长受阻。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：田园清洁，清除杂草、残株，减少越冬场所，合理轮作，避免连作加重为害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发生初期，用73%</span><span class="text-color-green">克螨特</span><span>乳油1000 - 1500倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">浏阳霉素</span><span>乳油1000 - 1500倍液等喷雾，着重喷植株上部幼嫩组织，5 - 7天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>番茄蓟马</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：成虫在杂草、土缝等隐蔽处越冬，具趋蓝性，喜温暖干燥，常活动于番茄花、叶片，以锉吸式口器吸食汁液，造成白斑、畸形，传播病毒病，20 - 28℃繁殖快，花期为害突出。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：田间悬挂蓝色粘虫板，种植前清除周边杂草，释放捕食螨、小花蝽等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用2.5%</span><span class="text-color-green">多杀霉素悬</span><span>浮剂1000 - 1500倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液等喷雾，</span><span class="text-color-green">乙基多杀菌素</span><span>也很好用。花期重点喷花，兼顾叶片，7 - 10天1次，喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>其他害虫：蛴螬，蝼蛄、地老虎，</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.2.3 茄子</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>猝倒病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：主要由瓜果腐霉菌侵染所致。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：多发生在早春育苗床或育苗盘上，种子出土前发病会造成烂种；出土后的幼苗发病，茎基部呈水渍状病斑，随后病部变黄褐色，缢缩成线状，在子叶尚未凋萎之前，幼苗便倒伏。湿度大时，病部附近长出白色棉絮状菌丝。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以卵孢子在土壤中越冬，在适宜的温度（15 - 16℃）和湿度条件下，孢子萌发产生芽管，从根部或茎基部侵入。苗床温度过低、湿度过大、光照不足、通风不良等条件均有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用疏松、肥沃、排水良好的土壤作苗床，播种前进行土壤消毒，如用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂或 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">福美双</span><span>可湿性粉剂与适量细土拌匀撒施。控制苗床湿度，避免浇水过多，保持良好的通风透光条件。发病初期，可选用 72.2% 普力克水剂 800 倍液、58% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵・锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>立枯病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由立枯丝核菌引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害幼苗茎基部或地下根部，初为椭圆形或不规则形暗褐色病斑，病苗早期白天萎蔫，夜间恢复，病斑逐渐凹陷，扩大后绕茎一周，最后病部收缩干枯，整株死亡。湿度大时，病部可见淡褐色蛛丝状霉。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以菌丝体或菌核在土壤中或病残体上越冬，在温度 17 - 28℃、湿度较大的条件下容易发病。重茬地、土壤黏重、排水不良、光照不足等均有利于该病的发生。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：加强苗床管理，注意通风透光，降低湿度。进行种子和苗床消毒，可用种子重量 0.3% 的 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">福美双</span><span>可湿性粉剂拌种，或用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂与 50% 福美双可湿性粉剂按 1:1 混合，每平方米用药 8 - 10 克与适量细土拌匀撒施苗床。发病初期，可选用 75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲基立枯磷</span><span>乳油 1200 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>黄萎病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>由大丽花轮枝孢菌（Verticillium dahliae Kleb.）引起，是一种土传性维管束病害。病菌以分生孢子和菌丝体在土壤中的病残体等位置越冬，其生命力顽强，在土壤里可以存活 6 - 8 年以上，有的甚至能存活 10 年。在温度 18 - 24℃时，病菌开始活跃。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要在结果后期发病，叶片是最直观的表现部位。初期近叶柄的叶缘部叶脉间褪绿，晴天高温时萎蔫，夜间或天气转阴时恢复正常。随着病情发展，萎蔫状态不能再恢复，褪绿部分变为黄白色至褐色，叶缘稍稍向上卷曲，且多由半边叶开始发病，这也是 “半边疯” 名称的由来。当病斑扩展到整片叶子之后，病叶干枯脱落，病害一般自下向上逐渐发展。病株的茎基部和根部维管束变为褐色，严重时全株叶片枯黄、植株萎缩。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原菌以分生孢子和菌丝体通过茄子植株的根部侵入。土壤是主要的传染源，连作地、土壤湿度较大的地块容易发病。病菌在土壤中积累，遇到适宜的温度和湿度条件，就会对茄子植株造成侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>品种选择：选用抗病品种，如快星、紫月、茄杂 2 号和茄杂 9 号等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生态防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>采用营养钵育苗，营养土应消毒，减少病原菌侵染。例如，用高温蒸汽消毒或化学药剂如 40% 五氯硝基苯粉剂与营养土混合消毒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>对苗床或大棚土壤进行处理，种植前深翻土壤、晒垡，也可使用棉隆等土壤熏蒸剂消毒。</span></');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0107', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '106', 'div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理，适当增施生物菌肥和磷钾肥，促进植株健壮生长。采用合理的灌溉方式，如滴灌或膜下暗灌，避免大水漫灌，降低湿度。及时整枝打杈，增强通风透光。收获后及时清除病残体，并用 50% 多菌灵可湿性粉剂与适量细土拌匀撒施消毒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>嫁接防病：以野生茄子作砧木与茄子嫁接换根，能有效防治因重茬、土壤带菌严重引起的黄萎病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子包衣防病：使用 2.5% 适乐时悬浮种衣剂和 35% 金普隆乳化种衣剂进行种子杀菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定植时生物农药处理：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>撒药土，将药土比为 1：50 倍的萎菌净与细土混合好，每穴每株 50 克，穴施后定植。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>也可用 1000 倍药液每穴 250 毫升灌坑。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂救治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病前或发病初期用 10 亿活孢子 / </span><span class="text-color-green">克枯草芽孢杆菌</span><span>可湿性粉剂灌根处理。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>还可使用化学药剂如 2.5％适乐时悬浮剂、75％</span><span class="text-color-green">达科宁</span><span>可湿性粉剂、80％大生可湿性粉剂、</span><span class="text-color-green">甲基托布津</span><span>可湿性粉剂、50％</span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂等灌根，每株灌药量 200 - 300 毫升，每隔 7 - 10 天灌一次，连续灌 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定植后药剂灌根：苗期和定植前后用90%</span><span class="text-color-green">恶霉灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂稀释2000-3000倍液或50%</span><span class="text-color-green">琥胶肥酸铜</span><span>可湿性粉剂500倍液进行灌根，每株灌60-100毫升药，也可用600-700倍液50%</span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂或70%</span><span class="text-color-green">甲基托布津</span><span>800-1000倍液灌根，每株灌约100毫升药，以上均5-7天灌根1次，连续灌根2-3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂喷施：茄子黄萎病在发病初期，及时选用77%</span><span class="text-color-green">可杀得可湿性粉剂</span><span>800-1000倍液、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>600-800倍液或70%</span><span class="text-color-green">甲基托布津</span><span>600-800倍液喷施茎部，7-10天左右喷施1次，连续防治2-3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>褐纹病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由茄褐纹拟茎点霉引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：从苗期到成株期均可发病，主要危害叶片、茎和果实。叶片发病，初为水渍状白色小点，后扩大为圆形或近圆形褐色病斑，病斑中央灰白色，边缘深褐色，上生许多小黑点。茎部发病，多在基部，病斑梭形，边缘深褐色，中央灰白色，上生小黑点，严重时茎部病斑凹陷、干缩，易折断。果实发病，初为浅褐色圆形病斑，后变为黑褐色，稍凹陷，上生许多小黑点，后期病果腐烂、脱落。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以菌丝体、分生孢子器在病残体上越冬，翌年产生分生孢子，借风雨、昆虫传播，从伤口或表皮侵入。高温高湿、通风不良、植株生长衰弱等条件有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用抗病品种，实行轮作，避免连作。种子消毒，可用 55℃温水浸种 15 - 20 分钟，或用种子重量 0.3% 的 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂拌种。加强田间管理，合理密植，及时清除病残体，保持通风透光。发病初期，可选用 75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、64% </span><span class="text-color-green">杀毒矾</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>枯萎病：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>由尖镰孢菌茄子专化型（Fusarium oxysporum f. sp. melongenae）引起，同样是维管束病害。菌丝体有隔，无色，分生孢子有大型分生孢子（镰刀形，多胞）和小型分生孢子（椭圆形，单胞）。病原菌以菌丝体、厚垣孢子在土壤、病残体或种子上越冬。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>一般从下部叶片开始发黄，逐渐向上发展，叶片萎蔫下垂，后期叶片干枯脱落。病株的茎基部维管束变为褐色。病情严重时，全株枯萎死亡。有时病株一侧的枝叶先枯萎，另一侧的枝叶后枯萎，呈现出 “半边枯” 的现象，但与黄萎病的 “半边疯” 在发病过程等方面有所不同。枯萎病主要是植株整体的枯萎过程，从下往上叶片逐渐黄化、枯萎，且叶片一般不脱落，而黄萎病有明显的叶片褪绿、恢复再到不能恢复的过程，并且叶片有向上卷曲的情况。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>通过土壤、灌溉水、农事操作等传播。在适宜的温度（24 - 28℃）和湿度条件下，病原菌从根部伤口或直接侵入根系，进入维管束系统，在植株体内繁殖，堵塞导管，导致植株枯萎。连作、土壤黏重、排水不良、施肥不当等情况容易引发枯萎病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>实行轮作，与非茄科作物轮作 3 - 4 年。选用抗病品种，如 “茄杂 2 号” 等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种子处理，用 55℃温水浸种 15 - 20 分钟，或用种子重量 0.3% - 0.5% 的 50% 福美双可湿性粉剂拌种。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理，增施有机肥和磷、钾肥，改善土壤结构，促进根系发育。合理浇水，避免田间积水。及时清除病株和病残体。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>土壤消毒，在种植前，可用 40% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲醛溶液（福尔马林）</span><span>对土壤进行消毒，每平方米用福尔马林 50 - 100 毫升，加水稀释后，均匀喷洒在土壤表面，然后用塑料薄膜覆盖，密封 2 - 3 天后揭开，晾晒 1 - 2 周后再种植。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期，可用 30% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜・恶霉灵</span><span>水剂 1000 - 1500 倍液或 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">氯溴异氰尿酸</span><span>可溶性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液进行灌根，每株灌药量 200 - 300 毫升，每隔 7 - 10 天灌 1 次，连续灌 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>绵疫病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由寄生疫霉引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害果实，也可危害叶片和茎。果实发病，初为水渍状圆形斑点，迅速扩展后病斑变为褐色或暗褐色，病部凹陷，湿度大时病斑上生有白色棉絮状菌丝。叶片发病，初为水渍状暗绿色斑点，后扩大为圆形或不规则形褐色病斑，严重时叶片腐烂。茎部发病，初为水渍状缢缩，后变黑褐色，病部以上枝叶萎蔫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以卵孢子在土壤中越冬，借雨水、灌溉水传播，在高温高湿（温度 25 - 30℃，相对湿度 85% 以上）条件下容易发病。地势低洼、排水不良、种植过密、通风透光差的地块发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用抗病品种，实行高畦栽培，合理密植，及时整枝打杈，保持通风透光。加强田间管理，避免田间积水，降低湿度。发病初期，可选用 64% 杀毒矾可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、58% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵・锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、72% </span><span class="text-color-green">克露</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>青枯病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由茄科劳尔氏菌引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：一般在开花结果期发病，初时植株叶片白天萎蔫，早晚恢复正常，随后叶片逐渐变黄，枯萎下垂，最后全株死亡。病株茎基部表皮粗糙，常产生不定根，纵切病茎可见维管束变为褐色，用手挤压有白色菌液流出。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌随病残体在土壤中越冬，可存活多年。主要通过雨水、灌溉水、农事操作等传播，从根部或茎基部伤口侵入。高温高湿、连作、土壤偏酸等条件有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：实行轮作，与非茄科作物轮作 3 - 4 年。选用抗病品种，如抗青 19 号等。加强田间管理，增施有机肥和钾肥，调节土壤酸碱度，使土壤呈微碱性。发现病株及时拔除，并用生石灰对病穴进行消毒。发病初期，可选用 72% </span><span class="text-color-green">农用硫酸链霉素</span><span>可溶性粉剂 4000 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">琥胶肥酸铜</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液等药剂灌根防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>炭疽病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0108', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '107', '  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由胶孢炭疽菌引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害叶片和果实。叶片发病，初为褪绿水渍状斑点，后扩大为圆形或近圆形褐色病斑，病斑中央灰白色，边缘深褐色，上生许多小黑点。果实发病，初为褐色圆形病斑，后扩大为黑褐色，病斑凹陷，上生许多小黑点，严重时果实腐烂。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以菌丝体、分生孢子盘在病残体上越冬，翌年产生分生孢子，借风雨、昆虫传播，从伤口或表皮侵入。高温高湿、通风不良、植株生长衰弱等条件有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：选用抗病品种，种子消毒，可用 55℃温水浸种 15 - 20 分钟。加强田间管理，合理密植，及时清除病残体，保持通风透光。发病初期，可选用 75% </span><span class="text-color-green">百菌清</span><span>可湿性粉剂 600 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">多菌灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、80% </span><span class="text-color-green">炭疽福美</span><span>可湿性粉剂 800 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由灰葡萄孢菌引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害叶片、茎和果实。叶片发病，初为水渍状褐色斑点，后扩大为近圆形或不规则形褐色病斑，病斑上有明显的轮纹，湿度大时病斑上生有灰色霉层。茎部发病，初为水渍状褐色斑点，后变为褐色长条斑，严重时茎部腐烂。果实发病，初为水渍状灰白色病斑，后变为褐色，病部软腐，湿度大时病斑上生有灰色霉层。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以菌丝体、分生孢子及菌核在病残体上越冬，翌年产生分生孢子，借风雨、气流传播，从伤口或衰弱部位侵入。低温高湿（温度 15 - 25℃，相对湿度 90% 以上）条件有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：加强通风透光，降低湿度，控制浇水，避免偏施氮肥。及时清除病残体，减少病菌来源。发病初期，可选用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">速克灵</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1500 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">扑海因</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 倍液、40% </span><span class="text-color-green">施佳乐</span><span>悬浮剂 800 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>菌核病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原：由核盘菌引起。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害茎基部和果实。茎基部发病，初为水渍状褐色病斑，后变为灰白色，病部软腐，表面生有白色棉絮状菌丝，后期在菌丝上形成黑色鼠粪状菌核。果实发病，初为水渍状褐色病斑，后变为灰白色，病部软腐，表面生有白色棉絮状菌丝，后期在菌丝上形成黑色菌核。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病菌以菌核在土壤中或病残体上越冬，翌年菌核萌发产生子囊盘，释放子囊孢子，借风雨、气流传播，从伤口或衰弱部位侵入。低温高湿（温度 15 - 20℃，相对湿度 85% 以上）条件有利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：实行轮作，与非茄科作物轮作 3 - 4 年。加强田间管理，及时清除病残体，保持通风透光，降低湿度。发病初期，可选用 50% 速克灵可湿性粉剂 1000 倍液、50% 扑海因可湿性粉剂 1000 倍液、40% </span><span class="text-color-green">菌核净</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，并及时清除病株，带出田间深埋或烧毁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>虫害</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蚜虫128 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：常见的有桃蚜、瓜蚜等。蚜虫繁殖能力强，一年可繁殖多代，以卵在越冬寄主上或以成蚜、若蚜在温室内蔬菜上越冬，翌年春季温度适宜时开始活动，群集在茄子的叶片、嫩茎、花蕾等部位吸食汁液。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，叶片卷曲、皱缩，生长不良；嫩茎、花蕾受害后，生长受阻，花朵不能正常开放，影响茄子的坐果率。此外，蚜虫还可传播多种病毒病，加重茄子的病情。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：可采用物理防治，如悬挂黄色诱虫板诱杀蚜虫；生物防治，释放瓢虫、草蛉等天敌昆虫；化学防治，可选用 10% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂 2000 - 3000 倍液、3% </span><span class="text-color-green">啶虫脒</span><span>乳油 1500 - 2000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>红蜘蛛128 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：主要有朱砂叶螨、二斑叶螨等。红蜘蛛以成螨、若螨在茄子叶片背面吐丝结网，吸食叶片汁液。在高温干旱的条件下繁殖迅速，一般在 7 - 8 月高温季节发生较重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，出现黄白色斑点，严重时叶片干枯脱落，影响茄子的光合作用，导致植株生长衰弱，产量降低。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：农业防治上，及时清除田间杂草和病残体，减少红蜘蛛的越冬场所。生物防治可释放捕食螨等天敌。化学防治可选用 1.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油 3000 - 4000 倍液、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">哒螨灵</span><span>乳油 1500 - 2000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，注意叶片背面要喷匀喷透。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蓟马123 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：常见的有西花蓟马、瓜蓟马等。蓟马体型微小，锉吸式口器，多在茄子的嫩梢、嫩叶、花和幼果等部位取食。蓟马喜欢温暖干旱的环境，一般在春季和秋季发生较重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，出现白色斑点，严重时叶片变小、变硬、卷曲；幼果受害后，表面出现锈褐色斑点，果实畸形，生长缓慢。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：物理防治可悬挂蓝色诱虫板诱杀蓟马。化学防治可选用 2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">多杀霉素</span><span>悬浮剂 1000 - 1500 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">溴虫氟苯双酰胺</span><span>悬浮剂 2000 - 3000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，注意在早晨或傍晚蓟马活动高峰期施药效果较好。杀蓟马卵用吡丙醚或唑虫酰胺</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茄螟13 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：又称茄黄斑螟，以幼虫蛀食茄子的花蕾、花蕊、子房、果实等部位，造成落花、落果及果实腐烂。幼虫老熟后在茄子的茎秆、残枝落叶等处结茧化蛹越冬。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：花蕾受害后，不能正常开放；果实受害后，内部被蛀食，形成孔洞，严重影响茄子的品质和产量。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：及时清除田间的落花、落果及残枝落叶，减少虫源。在幼虫孵化高峰期，可选用 2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">溴氰菊酯</span><span>乳油 2000 - 3000 倍液、5% </span><span class="text-color-green">高效氯氟氰菊酯</span><span>乳油 2000 - 3000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，重点喷施茄子的花蕾、幼果等部位。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茄二十八星瓢虫1310 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：主要危害茄子的叶片，以成虫和幼虫取食叶片的叶肉，仅留表皮，形成许多不规则的透明斑。成虫具有假死性，受惊后会落地装死。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害严重时，叶片干枯、破碎，影响茄子的光合作用，导致植株生长不良。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：人工捕捉成虫，利用其假死性，在清晨或傍晚进行捕杀。及时清除田间杂草和残株，减少瓢虫的栖息场所。化学防治可选用 2.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">溴氰菊酯乳油</span><span> 2000 - 3000 倍液、4.5% </span><span class="text-color-green">高效氯氰菊酯</span><span>乳油 1500 - 2000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>斑潜蝇168 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：常见的有美洲斑潜蝇、南美斑潜蝇等。斑潜蝇的成虫和幼虫均可危害茄子，成虫用产卵器刺伤叶片产卵，幼虫在叶片内潜食叶肉，形成不规则的蛇形白色虫道。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，光合作用受到影响，导致叶片早衰、脱落，严重影响茄子的生长和产量。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：农业防治上，合理轮作，与非豆科、茄科蔬菜轮作。物理防治可悬挂黄色诱虫板诱杀成虫。化学防治可选用 1.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油 3000 倍液、75% </span><span class="text-color-green">灭蝇胺</span><span>可湿性粉剂 5000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，重点喷施叶片背面。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉虱123 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：又称小白蛾子，以成虫和若虫群集在茄子叶片背面吸食汁液，分泌蜜露，诱发煤污病。白粉虱繁殖速度快，世代重叠严重，在温室和露地均可发生。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，出现褪绿变黄、萎蔫，严重时叶片干枯脱落。同时，蜜露污染叶片和果实，影响茄子的外观品质。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：物理防治可悬挂黄色诱虫板诱杀成虫，或安装防虫网防止白粉虱进入田间。生物防治可释放丽蚜小蜂等天敌昆虫。化学防治可选用 25% </span><span class="text-color-green">噻虫嗪</span><span>水分散粒剂 3000 - 4000 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">吡丙醚</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，注意叶片背面要喷匀喷透。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
 ');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0109', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '108', ' </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茶黄螨11012 ：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：成螨和幼螨集中在茄子的幼嫩部位，如嫩叶、嫩茎、花和幼果等，用口器刺入植物组织吸食汁液。茶黄螨喜欢温暖潮湿的环境，一般在夏季高温多雨季节发生较重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害症状：叶片受害后，叶片变厚变小、变硬，叶背呈茶锈色，油渍状，叶缘向下卷曲；嫩茎受害后，呈黄褐色，扭曲畸形；花和幼果受害后，不开花或开花异常，果实变小、变硬，表面粗糙，失去光泽，严重影响茄子的产量和品质。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：及时清除田间杂草和病残体，减少虫源。化学防治可选用 1.8% </span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油 3000 - 4000 倍液、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">哒螨灵</span><span>乳油 1500 - 2000 倍液等药剂喷雾防治，重点喷施茄子的幼嫩部位，每隔 7</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根结线虫</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原及习性：主要是南方根结线虫、北方根结线虫等。根结线虫以卵和二龄幼虫在土壤和病根残体中越冬。条件适宜时，卵孵化出二龄幼虫，侵入茄子根部。线虫在土壤中活动范围较小，主要靠农事操作、灌溉水、病土等传播。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害茄子根部。发病初期，地上部分植株生长缓慢，叶片发黄。地下部分根系产生大小不等的根结，根结初期为白色，后变为褐色，严重时多个根结连接在一起，使根系肿胀、畸形。根结上可生出细弱新根，再次被侵染后又形成根结。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：实行轮作，与非寄主植物如禾本科作物轮作 3 - 5 年。在种植前对土壤进行消毒，可使用棉隆等杀线虫剂处理土壤。生物防治可施用含有淡紫拟青霉的生物制剂，这种真菌可以寄生根结线虫。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>地老虎</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：常见的有小地老虎、黄地老虎等。地老虎是一种地下害虫，以幼虫为害茄子幼苗。成虫具有趋光性和趋化性，喜欢在杂草丛生的地方产卵。幼虫白天潜伏在土中，夜晚出土活动，咬断茄子幼苗的茎基部，造成缺苗断垄。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：幼苗茎基部被咬断，造成幼苗死亡。在受害植株周围的土壤表面可以发现明显的断苗痕迹。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：农业防治包括清除田间杂草，减少地老虎的产卵场所。物理防治可采用黑光灯诱捕成虫。化学防治可在幼虫期用 90% 晶体</span><span class="text-color-green">敌百虫</span><span> 800 - 1000 倍液灌根，或者用毒饵诱杀，如用炒香的麦麸或豆饼等与敌百虫混合后撒在田间。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蛴螬</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：蛴螬是金龟子的幼虫，种类繁多。它们生活在土壤中，主要取食植物的根系。蛴螬有假死性，喜欢在富含有机质的土壤中生存。一般在春季和秋季活动较为频繁。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害茄子根部，咬断或咬伤根系，使植株生长不良，叶片发黄、枯萎。严重时导致植株死亡。在受害植株根部周围的土壤中可以发现蛴螬。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：农业防治包括合理施肥，避免施用未腐熟的有机肥，因为这些肥料会吸引金龟子产卵。生物防治可利用天敌昆虫如步行虫、寄生蜂等来控制蛴螬数量。化学防治可在播种或定植前，用 50% </span><span class="text-color-green">辛硫磷</span><span>乳油拌种，或者用辛硫磷颗粒剂撒施在土壤中进行土壤处理。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>金针虫</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>种类及习性：金针虫是叩头虫的幼虫，主要在土壤中生活。它们具有趋湿性，喜欢在潮湿的土壤中活动。金针虫的活动能力较强，能够在土壤中上下移动，主要危害植物的根系和地下茎。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状表现：主要危害茄子的根部和地下茎，蛀食后造成植株生长衰弱，叶片发黄、萎蔫。在受害部位可以发现针状小孔。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：农业防治包括合理轮作、深耕土地，破坏金针虫的生存环境。化学防治可选用 40% 辛硫磷乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液灌根，或者在播种前用辛硫磷颗粒剂处理土壤。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.2.4 生菜</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>细菌性病害：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>暂无典型细菌性病害详述（如有生菜软腐病菌中的欧文氏菌归类争议，其兼具细菌病害特点，发病规律等类似十字花科软腐病）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律（以类似软腐病参考）：病原菌在病残体、土壤及害虫体内越冬，借助雨水、灌溉水、昆虫等传播，从植株伤口（如农事操作、虫咬伤口）侵入，高温高湿（25 - 30℃、相对湿度90%以上）、植株生长衰弱、田间积水易发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：合理轮作，避免连作，精细农事操作减少伤口，及时排水防涝，收获后清园，清除病残体。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用72%</span><span class="text-color-green">农用链霉素</span><span>可溶性粉剂3000 - 4000倍液、</span><span class="text-color-green">新植霉素</span><span>4000 - 5000倍液等喷雾或灌根，重点针对发病植株基部及周边，7 - 10天1次，连施2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>真菌性病害：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>霜霉病（Peronospora farinosa）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病原菌以卵孢子在病残体或土壤中越冬，15 - 20℃、相对湿度90%以上，卵孢子萌发产生游动孢子囊，借风雨传播到生菜叶片，从气孔或表皮侵入，种植过密、通风透光不良、湿度大环境发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选用抗病品种，合理密植，加强田间通风透光，及时清除病残体，高垄栽培利于排水降湿。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，可选用72%</span><span class="text-color-green">霜脲·锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂600 - 800倍液、69%</span><span class="text-color-green">烯酰·锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂800 - 1000倍液等喷雾，7 - 10天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span><span class="text-color-green">霜霉威</span><span>安全性高一些、</span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵，</span><span>在黄瓜上一喷雾器100g霜霉为盐酸盐也很安全；</span><span class="text-color-green">氟菌·霜霉威+烯酰·氰霜唑；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>灰霉病（Botrytis cinerea）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌核在土壤或病残体越冬，20 - 25℃、相对湿度90%以上，菌核萌发产分生孢子，借气流、雨水、农事操作传至植株，从伤口、衰弱组织侵入，生菜生长后期，植株茂密、通风差、湿度大易发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：加强通风，合理浇水，避免大水漫灌，及时摘除病叶、病株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用40%</span><span class="text-color-green">嘧霉胺</span><span>悬浮剂800 - 1000倍液、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂1000 - 1500倍液等喷雾，7 - 10天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>菌核病（Sclerotinia sclerotiorum）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：菌核在土壤或病残体蛰伏越冬，15 - 20℃、湿度适宜时，萌发产生子囊盘和子囊孢子，借气流、雨水传播，从衰弱或损伤组织侵入，连作、排水不良地块发病风险高。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：深翻土壤深埋菌核，轮作倒茬，清理病残体，保持田间卫生。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，可选用40%</span><span class="text-color-green">菌核净</span><span>可湿性粉剂1000 - 1500倍液、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利</span><span>可湿性粉剂1000 - 1500倍液喷雾或灌根，7 - 10天1次，连施2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉病（Erysiphe cichoracearum）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌丝体或闭囊壳在病残体越冬，20 - 25℃、相对湿度70%左右，分生孢子借气流传播，反复侵染，田间郁闭、通风透光差利于发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选抗病品种，合理密植，增施有机肥和磷钾肥，定期清理病残株，改善通风条件。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用25%</span><span class="text-color-green">粉锈宁（三唑酮）</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂800 - 1000倍液等喷雾，7 - 10天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生理病害：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>暂无典型单一详述生理病害（生菜生长常遇叶片黄化等，多与营养失衡、环境不良关联）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div ');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0110', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '109', 'class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律（以叶片黄化为例）：土壤肥力不足，缺乏氮、铁、镁等元素，或土壤酸碱度不适宜，水分供应失调（干旱或积水），光照过强或不足，导致叶片光合作用、呼吸作用等生理过程紊乱，出现黄化、生长缓慢等症状。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：测土配方施肥，依据生菜需肥规律补施肥料，改良土壤，保持适宜酸碱度，合理灌溉，避免强光直晒，可遮阳网调控光照。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：针对缺素，缺氮可追施尿素，缺铁喷施0.1% - 0.2%</span><span class="text-color-green">硫酸亚铁</span><span>溶液，缺镁喷施0.5%</span><span class="text-color-green">硫酸镁</span><span>溶液，调节水分、光照等环境因素，促进恢复。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病毒：</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>暂无典型严重病毒病害详述（生菜可能感染黄瓜花叶病毒等）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律（以黄瓜花叶病毒参考）：病毒在多年生杂草、种子、土壤等越冬，通过蚜虫等刺吸式害虫传毒，高温干旱（28 - 32℃）、生菜幼苗期至莲座期，植株抗性弱时易感染，田间杂草多、蚜虫防治不力易流行。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选用抗病品种，种子消毒（温水浸种等），清除田间杂草，防虫网防蚜虫迁入，悬挂黄色粘虫板诱杀蚜虫，培育壮苗。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用20%病毒A可湿性粉剂500倍液、1.5%植病灵乳剂1000倍液等喷雾，结合防治蚜虫药剂如10%吡虫啉可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液，7 - 10天1次，连喷3 - 4次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>虫害：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蚜虫（Aphididae）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以卵在杂草等寄主越冬，春天气温回升孵化，迁移至生菜，16 - 22℃、湿度适宜时繁殖快，群集叶片背面、嫩茎吸食，致叶片卷曲、畸形，传播病毒病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：田园周边除草，悬挂黄色粘虫板，保护利用瓢虫、草蛉等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：用10%</span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液、50%</span><span class="text-color-green">抗蚜威</span><span>可湿性粉剂2000 - 3000倍液等喷雾，7 - 10天1次，视虫情喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>潜叶蝇（Liriomyza spp.）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以蛹在土壤越冬，成虫产卵于生菜叶片表皮下，20 - 30℃时，幼虫孵化后在叶肉潜食，形成弯曲虫道，影响光合作用和品质，高温干旱利于繁殖。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：田园清洁，清除杂草残株，悬挂蓝色粘虫板诱杀成虫，合理轮作。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：幼虫初发期，用1.8%</span><span class="text-color-green">阿维菌素</span><span>乳油1000 - 1500倍液、40%</span><span class="text-color-green">灭蝇胺</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液等喷雾，重点喷叶片，7 - 10天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>蓟马（Thrips spp.）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：成虫在杂草、土缝越冬，趋蓝性，20 - 28℃活跃，在生菜叶片、花吸食，造成白斑、畸形，传播病毒，温暖干燥繁殖快。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：悬挂蓝色粘虫板，种植前清杂草，释放捕食螨等天敌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：用2.5%</span><span class="text-color-green">多杀霉素</span><span>悬浮剂1000 - 1500倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">吡虫啉</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液等喷雾，重点喷花和幼叶，7 - 10天1次，喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>跳甲（Phyllotreta spp.）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：成虫在田边杂草、残株及土缝越冬，春季温度回升（10℃以上）活动，趋嫩性、趋化性，跳跃至生菜，啃食叶片成孔洞，产卵于根部附近土壤，幼虫啃食根部，高温干旱时为害重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：田园清洁，深耕晒土，破坏越冬场所，覆盖地膜防成虫产卵，间作防虫植物（如大蒜等有驱虫作用）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：成虫期，用5%</span><span class="text-color-green">高效氯氟氰菊酯</span><span>乳油2000 - 3000倍液喷雾，幼虫期用40%</span><span class="text-color-green">辛硫磷</span><span>乳油1000倍液灌根，7 - 10天1次，依虫态防治2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.2.5玉米挪去主粮作物了</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2.2.5 草莓</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
