    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>细菌性病害：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓黏菌病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>初期病部布满胶黏状浅黄色液体，后期长出浅黄色圆柱形孢子囊（周围蓝黑色带白色短柄），覆盖叶片、叶柄和茎；近地面嫩叶、嫩心受害重，影响光合与呼吸，叶不能正常伸展，严重时植株枯死、果实腐烂</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
