  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>半圆双皮菌（Didermahemisphaericum）和白柄菌（Diachealeucopodia），属原生动物界黏菌门</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>黏菌分布广泛，凡有植物或残体处，温湿度适宜即生存；栽植过密、田间潮湿、杂草多利于发病蔓延</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业措施</span><span>：选高燥平坦沙性土栽植；雨后及时排水，避免大水漫灌；清除杂草残体，合理密植。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：发病初期喷50%多菌灵悬浮剂600倍液或45%噻菌灵悬浮剂1000-1500倍液，采收前7天停药。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>暂无典型严重细菌性病害详述（草莓可能受欧文氏菌等引发软腐类似情况）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律（参考软腐特点）：病原菌在病残体、土壤及害虫体内越冬，借助雨水、灌溉水、昆虫等传播，从植株伤口（采摘、机械损伤、虫咬等）侵入，高温高湿（25 - 30℃、相对湿度90%以上）、植株生长后期、果实成熟期易发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：合理轮作，避免连作，精细农事操作减少伤口，及时排水防涝，收获后清园，清除病残体，种植前土壤消毒（如用石灰氮等处理）。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用72%</span><span class="text-color-green">农用链霉素</span><span>可溶性粉剂3000 - 4000倍液、</span><span class="text-color-green">新植霉素</span><span>4000 - 5000倍液等喷雾或灌根，重点针对发病植株基部及周边，7 - 10天1次，连施2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>真菌性病害：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
');
INSERT INTO source_document_fragments (id, document_id, sort_order, content) VALUES ('source-fragment-0111', 'source-doc-4c784a84a66adf221597', '110', '    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓白粉病（Sphaerotheca macularis）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌丝体或闭囊壳在病残体及草莓植株上越冬，15 - 25℃、相对湿度80%左右，分生孢子借气流传播，反复侵染，在草莓生长中后期，植株郁闭、通风透光差、湿度大时发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>白粉病主要为害草莓的叶、叶柄、花、花梗和果实</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="italic">Podosphaeraaphanis</span><span>（滇赤才叉丝单囊壳），属子囊菌门</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
