  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选用抗病品种，合理密植，及时整枝打杈，改善通风透光，增施有机肥和磷钾肥，控制氮肥用量，定期清理病残株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：选抗病品种（如杜克拉、甜查理）；清洁园地，摘除病残叶；合理施肥，避免偏氮；高畦栽培，通风降湿。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生物防治：用100亿活芽孢/克枯草芽孢杆菌可湿性粉剂防治。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>化学防治：发病初期喷42.5%吡唑醚菌酯・氟唑菌酰胺悬浮剂2000倍液、50%醚菌酯水分散粒剂1000倍液；硫黄熏蒸预防保护地白粉病，发病期每天熏蒸8h，连用7～10次；发病初期可选50%翠贝干悬浮剂5000倍液、42.8%露娜森2000倍液、40%福星乳油8000倍液喷雾，7～10天喷1次，连续防治3次</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用25%</span><span class="text-color-green">粉锈宁（三唑酮）</span><span>可湿性粉剂1500 - 2000倍液、10%</span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂800 - 1000倍液等喷雾，7 - 10天1次，连喷2 - 3次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
