  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业防治</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>选用无病苗，实行洁净栽培；高畦栽培防积水，合理施肥忌偏施氮肥；低洼地及时排水；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>保护地采用高畦低灌，避免大水漫灌；园内铺谷壳减少病原菌传播；及时清除病果病株。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>定植前：用30%恶霉灵1500倍液土壤处理；秋季定植时用53%精甲霜・锰锌800倍液浸根；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>花期开始：喷70%锰锌・乙铝500倍液、53%精甲霜・锰锌500倍液等，隔10天1次，连续3~4次；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>生长期：喷淋68%精甲霜・锰锌600倍液、47%春雷・王铜700倍液等</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓灰霉病（Botrytis cinerea）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：以菌核在土壤或病残体越冬，18 - 23℃、相对湿度 90% 以上时，菌核萌发产生分生孢子，借助气流、雨水、农事操作在草莓园内传播，多从残花、柱头及伤口等部位侵入，花期、果实膨大期遇连阴天、高湿环境发病严重，常造成花腐、果腐。可半腐生；孢子借风雨、农事操作传播；病果相互接触及分生孢子可引发再侵染</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
