<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="italic">BotrytiscinereaPers.exFr.</span><span>，称灰葡萄孢，属半知菌类真菌</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，可选用 40% </span><span class="text-color-green">嘧霉胺</span><span>悬浮剂 800 - 1000 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">异菌脲</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液、50% </span><span class="text-color-green">腐霉利</span><span>可湿性粉剂 1000 - 1500 倍液等喷雾，重点喷施花朵、幼果及发病部位周边，7 - 10 天喷 1 次，连续喷 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业措施</span><span>：通风、轮作；深沟高畦、地膜覆盖及膜下灌溉，通风降湿；及时摘除病果、老叶及感病花序。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病初期40%嘧霉胺悬浮剂1200倍液或50%腐霉利可湿性粉剂1500~2000倍液，7~10天一次，连续2~3次；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>开花前用10%腐霉利烟剂或45%百菌清烟剂烟熏，每亩300~400g，傍晚点燃密闭一夜；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：采用高畦栽培、地膜覆盖，合理控制种植密度，保证良好通风透光条件；花期、果期严格控制浇水频次与浇水量，避免田间积水、湿度过大；及时摘除病花、病果、病叶，带出田外集中深埋或烧毁，减少病原菌基数。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓黑腐病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要为害果实，被害果实初为浅褐色水渍状病斑，继而迅速软化腐烂流汤，切开果肉变黑，果实上生颗粒状黑霉，很快腐烂并波及相邻果实。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
