<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>胶孢炭疽菌、尖孢炭疽菌、草莓炭疽菌，属真菌界无性型子囊菌炭疽菌属</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>危害部位：匍匐茎、叶柄、叶片、果实、根茎部。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>具体表现：叶片有圆形/不规则病斑（0.5-1.5mm，黑或浅灰）；叶柄/匍匐茎呈纺锤形凹陷斑（中央棕褐、边缘紫红）；根茎部新叶高温时萎蔫；果实有近圆形凹陷软腐斑，后期生肉红色黏质孢子团</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根茎部染病，最初症状是病株最新的2～3个叶片在一天最热的时候出现萎蔫，然后傍晚恢复过来</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选用无病健壮种苗，进行种苗消毒（如用咪鲜胺锰盐等药剂浸种、浸苗）；避免连作，与非蔷薇科作物实行轮作或间作；合理密植，及时摘除老叶、病叶，改善田间通风透光；加强田间排水系统建设，避免积水。栽培：选抗病品种（森格纳、甜查理等），合理密植，增施磷钾肥，清除病残体</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病前可定期喷施保护性杀菌剂，如</span><span class="text-color-green">代森锰锌、百菌清</span><span>等；发病初期，选用 25% </span><span class="text-color-green">咪鲜胺</span><span>乳油 1000 - 1500 倍液、10% </span><span class="text-color-green">苯醚甲环唑</span><span>水分散粒剂 800 - 1000 倍液、20% </span><span class="text-color-green">唑菌胺</span><span>酯水分散粒剂 1000 - 1500 倍液等喷雾，7 - 10 天 1 次，连续喷 2 - 3 次，确保药剂均匀覆盖植株。苗期用25%嘧菌酯1500倍液、80%代森锰锌700倍液交替喷施；发病初期用25%溴菌腈500倍液、50%咪鲜胺1500倍液等</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓根腐病（Phytophthora cactorum）：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律：病原菌以卵孢子、厚垣孢子等在土壤及病残体中越冬，在土壤温度 10 - 25℃、湿度大且持续时间长、土壤透气性差的环境下，孢子萌发产生游动孢子，通过雨水、灌溉水及农事操作等传播，从草莓根系伤口或幼嫩组织侵入，连作地、地势低洼、土壤黏重、排水不良地块发病严重，草莓生长前期根系受损后更易被侵染。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>预防方法：选择地势高、排水良好、土质疏松的地块种植；实行轮作倒茬，与水稻等进行水旱轮作效果更佳；种植前对土壤进行消毒处理，可选用棉隆、威百亩等熏蒸剂，改善土壤微生物环境；合理施肥，增施有机肥、生物菌肥，增强根系活力与抗病性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法：发病初期，用 58% </span><span class="text-color-green">甲霜灵・锰锌</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 - 600 倍液、64% </span><span class="text-color-green">杀毒矾</span><span>可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、72.2% </span><span class="text-color-green">普力克</span><span>水剂 800 倍液等灌根，每株灌药量 200 - 300 毫升，7 - 10 天灌 1 次，连续灌 2 - 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓红中柱根腐</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
