    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>Phytophthora fragariae var.fragariae（草莓红心病菌），属假菌界卵菌门疫霉属；还可分离到丝核菌和拟盘多毛孢属真菌。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌以卵孢子在土壤中存活，通过土壤或种子传染；晚秋初冬产生孢子囊，释放游动孢子侵入根部；土壤低温高湿（地温 10℃为适温，高于 25℃不发病）、春秋多雨、低洼排水不良或大水漫灌时易发病</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">栽培管理</span><span>：选用无病地育苗，实行 4 年以上轮作，土壤消毒（每 667m² 用石灰氮 20kg），使用脱毒母株；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">阻断传播</span><span>：分苗地选高地块防积水，雨后喷施百菌清等药剂，母株定植时用甲基托布津或恶霉灵混土沟施；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">养根壮株</span><span>：喷淋甲基托布津混养根素或灌根；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：定植后及时拔除病株，用 50% 甲霜灵 1000-1500 倍液、70% 代森锰锌 500 倍液喷雾，或 64% 杀毒矾 500 倍液、72% 霜脲・锰锌 800 倍液等灌根消毒土壤。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
