    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">根部</span><span>：染病初呈水渍状，很快变黑腐烂，轻则地上部植株萎蔫，重则全株枯死；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">果实</span><span>：贴近地面或贴地果实易发病，病部呈水渍状，熟果略呈褐色至微紫色，软腐且略有弹性，果面长满浓密白色棉状菌丝；叶柄、果梗也会变黑干枯。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>Pythium ultimum Trow（终极腐霉），属假菌界卵菌门腐霉属。菌丝多分枝，孢子囊多间生（近球形），藏卵器球形（大多顶生），卵孢子球形（壁平滑），菌丝生长适温 28~36℃。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌在土壤、植株残体及未腐熟有机肥中存活越冬；条件适宜时，孢子囊释放游动孢子，借灌溉水或雨水传播，从根部侵入；高温高湿持续时间长、高温频繁浇水、重茬黏土地发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业防治</span><span>：选避风向阳高燥地块；苗床或定植前太阳能土壤消毒；高畦栽培防积水，忌漫灌；合理施肥不偏施氮肥；地膜栽培或垫果。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：秋季定植时用 30% 恶霉灵水剂 600 倍液浸根；生长期喷淋 68% 精甲霜・锰锌水分散粒剂 600 倍液、47% 春雷・王铜可湿性粉剂 700 倍液等；发病初期可用 25% 甲霜灵可湿性粉剂。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
