    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">花序 / 幼芽</span><span>：青枯并逐渐枯萎呈灰褐色；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
