    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">托叶 / 叶柄基部</span><span>：黑褐色病变，叶正面颜色深于背面，脆且易碎；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">植株</span><span>：最终猝倒状或变褐枯死，茎基部和根皮层腐烂，地上部易拔起；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
