  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">果实</span><span>：成熟期受害，病部褐色软腐、略凹陷。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="italic">Phomopsis obscurans</span><span>（昏暗拟茎点霉），属真菌界无性型子囊菌。分生孢子器球形至扁球形，壁薄膜质；分生孢子圆筒形，无色透明，含 1~2 个油点。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌以菌丝体或分生孢子器在病残体中越冬，翌年条件适宜时产生分生孢子，借雨水溅射传播进行初侵染和多次再侵染。南方多在 12 月～翌年 4 月发生，北方 6~7 月发病并延续至 9 月底；温暖多湿、时晴时雨的天气易加重病情。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业防治</span><span>：选用抗病品种（如戈雷拉、因都卡、明宝等）；地膜覆盖栽培减少初侵染；定植前清除病残体及病叶集中烧毁；适量浇水，雨后及时排水。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">药剂防治</span><span>：发病初期喷淋 50% 琥胶肥酸铜可湿性粉剂 500 倍液、10% 苯醚甲环唑微乳剂 2000 倍液或 62.25% 代・腈菌可湿性粉剂 600 倍液，隔 7~10 天 1 次，共喷 3 次。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
