<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓蛇眼病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node heading3">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">症状</span><span>：又称白斑病 / 叶斑病，主要为害老叶。叶斑初期为暗紫红色小斑点，扩大成 2~5mm 圆形病斑，边缘紫红色、中心灰白色，具细轮纹（酷似蛇眼）；病斑表面生白色粉状霉层，后生小黑点；病斑多融合成大斑致叶片褐枯，浆果种子受害后周围果肉变黑。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
