<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">病原</span><span>：有性态为草莓蛇眼球腔菌（</span><span class="italic">Mycosphaerella fragariae</span><span>），无性态为杜拉柱隔孢（</span><span class="italic">Ramularia tulasnei</span><span>），属真菌界子囊菌门 / 无性真菌类。分生孢子圆筒形，无色单胞或 1~2 隔膜；子囊孢子卵形无色有隔膜。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">发生规律</span><span>：病菌以菌丝在枯叶病斑越冬，翌春分生孢子初侵染，再侵染。适温 18~22℃，低于 7℃或高于 23℃发育迟缓；秋季春季光照不足、阴湿，重茬田、管理粗放、排水不良地块发病重。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">防治方法</span><span>：</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">农业</span><span>：选抗病品种（戈雷拉、因都卡、明宝等）；清理病叶烧毁，摘除病残老叶；合理密植通风透光，避免重茬。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span class="bold">化学</span><span>：发病初期喷 2% 农抗 120 / 武夷菌素 200 倍（隔 6-7 天 1 次）、27% 高脂膜乳剂 80-100 倍（5-6 天 1 次连喷 3-4 次）；或用 25% 三唑酮 2000 倍、多氧霉素 1000 倍等；大棚用 45% 百菌清烟熏剂 200-250 克。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓细菌性叶斑病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要为害叶片，初现水浸状红褐色不规则斑，扩大融合后变浅红褐色干枯；湿度大时叶背有菌脓，干燥成薄膜，叶尖叶缘处病斑易致叶片干缩破碎，严重时生长点枯死，叶柄、匍匐茎、花也可受害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓黄单胞菌（Xanthomonas fragariae），属细菌，菌体杆状，极生 1 鞭毛，革兰阴性，菌落圆形黄色有黏性。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病菌在种子、病残体或土壤越冬，借雨水、灌溉水、伤口传播，从水孔或伤口侵入；高温多雨、连作、低洼积水、伤口多等易发病。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>农业防治：检疫防传播，清除病残，减少伤口，合理水肥，雨后排水；</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：定植前土壤消毒，发病初期用72% 农用链霉素可湿性粉剂3000～4000 倍液、春雷霉素等药剂喷雾，隔 7-10 天 1 次，连防 3-4 次。或30% 碱式硫酸铜悬浮剂500 倍液，或1% 新植霉素可湿性粉剂3000～5000倍液，或2% 春雷霉素水剂400～500 倍液，或2% 武夷霉素水剂150～200 倍液喷雾，隔7～10 天喷1 次，连续防治3～4 次。采收前7 天停止用</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>图片</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div ');
