<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓病毒病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓病毒病由多种病毒单独或复合侵染引起，常见症状包括植株矮化、叶片花叶（浓淡不均斑驳）、黄边、皱缩畸形，果实变小、产量降低；复合侵染时症状更严重，如叶片扭曲变形、植株严重矮化甚至死亡；部分病毒（如绿瓣病毒）可导致花瓣变绿、花序畸形。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要病原包括草莓斑驳病毒（SMoV）、轻型黄边病毒（SMYEV）、皱缩病毒（SCV）、镶脉病毒（SVBV）等，分属不同病毒科（如 SMoV 属伴生豇豆病毒科、SMYEV 属甲型线形病毒科），病毒粒子形态有球形、线形等。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>传播途径：主要通过带病毒的无性繁殖材料（母株）远距离传播；田间通过介体蚜虫（草莓钉毛蚜等）取食迁飞传毒。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>发病条件：同一地块连年种植、偏施氮肥抗病性弱时发病重；病毒具潜伏侵染特性，复合侵染加重危害。</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
