<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓线虫病</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>草莓线虫病概括</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>1. 症状</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>芽线虫：为害芽和匍匐茎，轻者新叶发育不良、皱缩畸形、深绿有光泽；重者整株萎蔫，芽 / 叶柄变黄红，花蕾花萼畸形，花芽无法发育致不结果（减产 30%-60%）</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根结线虫：根部形成大小不等根结，剖开可见乳白色线虫，地上部发育不良或死亡</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎线虫：叶柄隆起、叶片扭曲，花和果实形成虫瘿，植株矮化</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>2. 病原</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>主要为草莓芽线虫（Aphelenchoides fragariae）、根结线虫（Meloidogyne incognita等）、茎线虫（Ditylenchus dipsaci），还包括水稻干尖线虫、咖啡短体线虫等</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>3. 发生规律</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>芽线虫：种苗携带初侵染，连作地土壤残留；靠雨水 / 灌溉水传播，28-32℃夏秋季严重</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>根结线虫：卵 / 2 龄幼虫越冬，病土 / 病苗 / 灌溉水传播；25-30℃最适，55℃10 分钟致死</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>茎线虫：随寄主种子 / 鳞茎传播，水旱轮作可减轻为害</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>4. 防治方法</span></div>
    
    
    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>培育无虫苗：不从被害园繁苗，发现病苗立即拔除烧毁，必要时检疫</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>轮作：与禾本科等非寄主作物轮作，水旱轮作效果更佳</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>高温处理种苗：35℃温水预热 10 分钟，再用 45-46℃热水浸 10 分钟，冷却后栽植</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>药剂防治：定植前用 1.8% 阿维菌素乳油 1500 倍液或 20% 辣根素土壤处理；土壤消毒可用克线丹、石灰氮</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>加强田间管理：重点加强夏季苗圃管理，防止线虫密度升高</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
