    <div class="children"><ul class="node-list">
    <li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>叶片部分冻死而干</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>花蕊受冻后变为黑褐色且死亡</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
    <div class="content mm-editor" ><span>冻害发生时，有的叶片部分冻死而干枯；有的花蕊和柱头受冻后柱头向上隆起干缩，花蕊变成黑褐色且死亡，花瓣变成红色或紫红色；幼果受冻时停止发育，变成暗红色，干枯且僵死，大果受冻后变褐</span></div>
    
    
    
  </li>
  </ul></div>
  </li>
<li class="node">
    <div class="bullet">
    <div class="bullet-dot"></div>
  </div>
    
